(3166860, 443031, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fun image - the repetition of that more distant cone-shape (whatever it is, but it''s the right shape) adds some depth to the composition. Good exposure, but could perhaps have used some human interest, or at least something more than is here to really hold attention.</td>', 'Fun image - the repetition of that more distant cone-shape (whatever it is, but it''s the right shape) adds some depth to the composition. Good exposure, but could perhaps have used some human interest, or at least something more than is here to really hold attention.', '2007-01-01 08:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3166864, 443793, 5354, '<td valign="top">Spurn Point is one of my favourite places. For seals you can also try Donna Nook down on the Lincolnshire coast. I always try to get the camera down low when taking seals. Shots taken from eye level have more impact. Good attempt though.</td>', 'Spurn Point is one of my favourite places. For seals you can also try Donna Nook down on the Lincolnshire coast. I always try to get the camera down low when taking seals. Shots taken from eye level have more impact. Good attempt though.', '2007-01-01 08:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3166866, 445086, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice moment. I like the mystery of your composition too - the hiding behind bushes feel. I think it could use more contrast in processing - the detail that''s visible in the foreground grasses or whatever isn''t really useful compared to what more contrast might achieve in the shapes of the gulls and the man.</td>', 'Nice moment. I like the mystery of your composition too - the hiding behind bushes feel. I think it could use more contrast in processing - the detail that''s visible in the foreground grasses or whatever isn''t really useful compared to what more contrast might achieve in the shapes of the gulls and the man.', '2007-01-01 08:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3166869, 445132, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quite pretty - but just quite, to my eye. Could use more saturation, and possibly contrast in the foreground areas to give it some bite; and the sky lacks a little drama. That''s in DPC terms, of course: I''d say this is a good honest (ie not over-dramatised in processing) photograph, and deserves to score better than it will. Do have a slight feeling that it might have benefitted from a touch of final sharpening for the presentation here - but that''s almost just a matter of taste.</td>', 'Quite pretty - but just quite, to my eye. Could use more saturation, and possibly contrast in the foreground areas to give it some bite; and the sky lacks a little drama. That''s in DPC terms, of course: I''d say this is a good honest (ie not over-dramatised in processing) photograph, and deserves to score better than it will. Do have a slight feeling that it might have benefitted from a touch of final sharpening for the presentation here - but that''s almost just a matter of taste.', '2007-01-01 08:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3166896, 440885, 5354, '<td valign="top">This is getting close to my top pick, but has a couple of flaws which just hold it back. First the skin on the cheeks seams a little plastic, maybe need to reduce the opacity of the post processing, and second the wording behind him needs to be symmetrically placed. Move him just 6 inches to the right of frame. Good work though.</td>', 'This is getting close to my top pick, but has a couple of flaws which just hold it back. First the skin on the cheeks seams a little plastic, maybe need to reduce the opacity of the post processing, and second the wording behind him needs to be symmetrically placed. Move him just 6 inches to the right of frame. Good work though.', '2007-01-01 08:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3166897, 443519, 66635, '<td valign="top">Love the moonlight on the water.  Beautiful.  Nice job.</td>', 'Love the moonlight on the water.  Beautiful.  Nice job.', '2007-01-01 08:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3166898, 445382, 5354, '<td valign="top">Stunning, utter perfection.</td>', 'Stunning, utter perfection.', '2007-01-01 08:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
