(3166911, 444639, 5354, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this I really liked it. Now I study it a little more closely for the top 10 placements I notice a few minor flaws which take it off the top spot. I would have liked the row-boat to be just a yard to so further into frame, they just need a little more space behind the boat. Similarly with the ship, I feel it needs to be slightly further into the frame to really set the contrast in size. Great work though.</td>', 'When I first saw this I really liked it. Now I study it a little more closely for the top 10 placements I notice a few minor flaws which take it off the top spot. I would have liked the row-boat to be just a yard to so further into frame, they just need a little more space behind the boat. Similarly with the ship, I feel it needs to be slightly further into the frame to really set the contrast in size. Great work though.', '2007-01-01 08:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
