(3168584, 443062, 23458, '<td valign="top">A well composed image of a great subject. I love the texture created by your choice of processing, however, the halo around the man detracts somewhat from its effectiveness. I also find the background somewhat distracting - 7.</td>', 'A well composed image of a great subject. I love the texture created by your choice of processing, however, the halo around the man detracts somewhat from its effectiveness. I also find the background somewhat distracting - 7.', '2007-01-01 23:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168589, 441110, 18367, '<td valign="top">For your sake I do hope most of the voters have properly calibrated monitors.  This is indeed a stunning image, but having viewed it on three different monitors I fear that some voters may not appreciate the more subtle colours of the image.<br/> <br/>Beautiful image that so far is the best I have seen.  The reflections, shadows, hues and sunlight all combine to produce a captivating vista.  Very well done indeed, and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'For your sake I do hope most of the voters have properly calibrated monitors.  This is indeed a stunning image, but having viewed it on three different monitors I fear that some voters may not appreciate the more subtle colours of the image. Beautiful image that so far is the best I have seen.  The reflections, shadows, hues and sunlight all combine to produce a captivating vista.  Very well done indeed, and good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-01 23:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168598, 441709, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and use of negative space. I like that you have managed to keep the second eye visible. It definately adds to the feeling conveyed. <br/> <br/>I would suggest cloning out the white on the collar as it''s a little distracting. Also - you seem to have pushed the contrast quite a bit, which is really effective in the region of the eyes, but has left the lips looking  redder than they would ordinarily.</td>', 'Nice composition and use of negative space. I like that you have managed to keep the second eye visible. It definately adds to the feeling conveyed.  I would suggest cloning out the white on the collar as it''s a little distracting. Also - you seem to have pushed the contrast quite a bit, which is really effective in the region of the eyes, but has left the lips looking  redder than they would ordinarily.', '2007-01-01 23:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168599, 445360, 31341, '<td valign="top">I think if the lighting and sharpness were better this might have some promise.</td>', 'I think if the lighting and sharpness were better this might have some promise.', '2007-01-01 23:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168600, 436119, 12200, '<td valign="top">The blurry motion is unconvincing to me, in this shot. It''s a nice color blend and an understandable attempt...but I''m just not getting sold on it.</td>', 'The blurry motion is unconvincing to me, in this shot. It''s a nice color blend and an understandable attempt...but I''m just not getting sold on it.', '2007-01-01 23:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168602, 442916, 23458, '<td valign="top">The light in here is really nice. You''ve done an excellent job of capturing the room''s warmth. The composition could be perhaps be improved - the door frame (and, in particular, the hinges) on the right is slightly distracting.</td>', 'The light in here is really nice. You''ve done an excellent job of capturing the room''s warmth. The composition could be perhaps be improved - the door frame (and, in particular, the hinges) on the right is slightly distracting.', '2007-01-01 23:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168604, 445222, 31341, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what it is, but your post processing makes the deer look artificial.</td>', 'I am not sure what it is, but your post processing makes the deer look artificial.', '2007-01-01 23:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168607, 445066, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very cute - a nice catch. The light is perhaps a bit flat - and stops this shot from really grabbing the viewer. 5</td>', 'Very cute - a nice catch. The light is perhaps a bit flat - and stops this shot from really grabbing the viewer. 5', '2007-01-01 23:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168608, 444314, 12200, '<td valign="top">This is a fine shot. I rate it a 4 not because it''s a weak composition, but simply because the wide array of approaches in this Free Study compel me to put this on the "less original" side of the coin. Excellent work.</td>', 'This is a fine shot. I rate it a 4 not because it''s a weak composition, but simply because the wide array of approaches in this Free Study compel me to put this on the "less original" side of the coin. Excellent work.', '2007-01-01 23:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168609, 444924, 12200, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Foreground seems unintentionally blurry...a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice idea. Foreground seems unintentionally blurry...a bit distracting.', '2007-01-01 23:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168610, 435842, 41047, '<td valign="top">nice portrait, i like the dof and the title.</td>', 'nice portrait, i like the dof and the title.', '2007-01-01 23:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168612, 445058, 12200, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge. So serene and quietly warm.</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge. So serene and quietly warm.', '2007-01-01 23:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168615, 443076, 41047, '<td valign="top">beautiful light</td>', 'beautiful light', '2007-01-01 23:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168616, 443681, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely leading line and intensity of tone and texture. One of the best. 8</td>', 'Lovely leading line and intensity of tone and texture. One of the best. 8', '2007-01-01 23:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168617, 444737, 41047, '<td valign="top">beautiful, i love the colours.</td>', 'beautiful, i love the colours.', '2007-01-01 23:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168618, 442904, 23458, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition here. The sky is particularly vibrant. The shot would be well served by a deeper DOF.</td>', 'Interesting composition here. The sky is particularly vibrant. The shot would be well served by a deeper DOF.', '2007-01-01 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168620, 445321, 12200, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge. Superb composition. The only small suggestion (which doesn''t affect my rating) would be to experiment with the removal of the tree branches to see if it makes the lamp posts that much more striking. I really can''t decide how I would like it better, though.</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge. Superb composition. The only small suggestion (which doesn''t affect my rating) would be to experiment with the removal of the tree branches to see if it makes the lamp posts that much more striking. I really can''t decide how I would like it better, though.', '2007-01-01 23:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168622, 445230, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent leading line, tone, light and shadow. I like the guy''s silhouette to add the human element to the otherwise industrial feel of the shot. I like the sun poking from behind the building on the left. One of the best.</td>', 'Excellent leading line, tone, light and shadow. I like the guy''s silhouette to add the human element to the otherwise industrial feel of the shot. I like the sun poking from behind the building on the left. One of the best.', '2007-01-01 23:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168623, 437887, 64446, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. Lots of details and textures, with vivid colours.</td>', 'Excellent composition. Lots of details and textures, with vivid colours.', '2007-01-01 23:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168625, 437531, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp stop of the motion here. I would probably prefer this if the entire seagull was in the grame - but a good effort nonetheless.</td>', 'Nice sharp stop of the motion here. I would probably prefer this if the entire seagull was in the grame - but a good effort nonetheless.', '2007-01-01 23:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168628, 438614, 41047, '<td valign="top">nice processing, i like the colours.</td>', 'nice processing, i like the colours.', '2007-01-01 23:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168629, 445143, 12200, '<td valign="top">I think the color of the border is off on this one. I find it distracting from the subject...maybe something darker?</td>', 'I think the color of the border is off on this one. I find it distracting from the subject...maybe something darker?', '2007-01-01 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168631, 444663, 41047, '<td valign="top">cute kitty, i like the bokeh of christmas tree lights.</td>', 'cute kitty, i like the bokeh of christmas tree lights.', '2007-01-01 23:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3168632, 444383, 25773, '<td valign="top">Although the head is in focus, a big part of the body occupying large part of the picture is not. It is also unlucky that the bird is looking out from the frame.</td>', 'Although the head is in focus, a big part of the body occupying large part of the picture is not. It is also unlucky that the bird is looking out from the frame.', '2007-01-01 23:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
