(3168645, 444768, 25773, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how delicate it is, but certainly impressed me with the angle/sharpness and composition...and the look on the face. The only thing I find distracting is the pinkish collar.</td>', 'I don''t know how delicate it is, but certainly impressed me with the angle/sharpness and composition...and the look on the face. The only thing I find distracting is the pinkish collar.', '2007-01-01 23:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
