(3168662, 444714, 12200, '<td valign="top">Not how I would have had one of my photo subjects dress, but I have to say, this is a very flattering portrait. Thanks for sharing!</td>', 'Not how I would have had one of my photo subjects dress, but I have to say, this is a very flattering portrait. Thanks for sharing!', '2007-01-01 23:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
