(3168671, 445327, 65025, '<td valign="top">Nice use of framing, nice closeup, nice tones.  And I don''t mind the graininess, it sort of adds character.</td>', 'Nice use of framing, nice closeup, nice tones.  And I don''t mind the graininess, it sort of adds character.', '2007-01-01 23:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
