(3168685, 444445, 65025, '<td valign="top">Nice use of repetition.  The sky also adds to the mood. It might make the photo more dynamic if you had one of the crosses closer, kind of as more of a focal point.</td>', 'Nice use of repetition.  The sky also adds to the mood. It might make the photo more dynamic if you had one of the crosses closer, kind of as more of a focal point.', '2007-01-02 00:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
