(3168692, 443367, 65025, '<td valign="top">Very very cool...I love the lights.  I might crop off more of the bottom to make it more the rule of thirds.  9</td>', 'Very very cool...I love the lights.  I might crop off more of the bottom to make it more the rule of thirds.  9', '2007-01-02 00:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
