(3168821, 439803, 19982, '<td valign="top">Playing with shallow DOF is fun ... and difficult.  The eyebrows look sharper than the eyes.  Looks like a spot on the tip of her nose as well that could have been cloned or smoothed.  Other than that, I do think she has gorgeous eyes and hope we''ll see more of her in the future.</td>', 'Playing with shallow DOF is fun ... and difficult.  The eyebrows look sharper than the eyes.  Looks like a spot on the tip of her nose as well that could have been cloned or smoothed.  Other than that, I do think she has gorgeous eyes and hope we''ll see more of her in the future.', '2007-01-02 00:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
