(3169136, 443695, 59415, '<td valign="top">Very cute image.  I like the composition, but the lighting could reveal a little more detail for my liking.</td>', 'Very cute image.  I like the composition, but the lighting could reveal a little more detail for my liking.', '2007-01-02 03:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
