(3169936, 443648, 12200, '<td valign="top">One of my fav''s this challenge.</td>', 'One of my fav''s this challenge.', '2007-01-02 10:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169947, 445295, 12200, '<td valign="top">I could be wrong, but it looks like there was some obvious cloning or brushwork or something in the lower right hand corner. Maybe it''s just a texture against the light; I can''t tell. Whatever it is, I find it distracting, so you might considre retouching this to get it out of there. Can you see it?</td>', 'I could be wrong, but it looks like there was some obvious cloning or brushwork or something in the lower right hand corner. Maybe it''s just a texture against the light; I can''t tell. Whatever it is, I find it distracting, so you might considre retouching this to get it out of there. Can you see it?', '2007-01-02 10:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
