(3170004, 439631, 64888, '<td valign="top">How did you get a picture of the All American Rejects!</td>', 'How did you get a picture of the All American Rejects!', '2007-01-02 10:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170011, 444964, 51538, '<td valign="top">Implicit numbers in your photo provide interest - 2 trails + 1 waterfowl.  3 is a nice uneven number.  I like the silhouettes and colours too. 8.</td>', 'Implicit numbers in your photo provide interest - 2 trails + 1 waterfowl.  3 is a nice uneven number.  I like the silhouettes and colours too. 8.', '2007-01-02 10:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170015, 443692, 48797, '<td valign="top">This is surreal, like the intestines of Gollum hung to freeze-dry. But it is beautiful - nature teaches us to appreciate the bizarre, too. Thanks for this, it''s a great photo.</td>', 'This is surreal, like the intestines of Gollum hung to freeze-dry. But it is beautiful - nature teaches us to appreciate the bizarre, too. Thanks for this, it''s a great photo.', '2007-01-02 10:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170020, 442344, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice worm''s eye view point.  The tint you chose works well. 7.</td>', 'Nice worm''s eye view point.  The tint you chose works well. 7.', '2007-01-02 10:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170021, 442386, 51538, '<td valign="top">The waves and reflections therefrom remind me of paintings.  Overall a nice composition.  I think there are some artifacts in the foggy sky though. 7.</td>', 'The waves and reflections therefrom remind me of paintings.  Overall a nice composition.  I think there are some artifacts in the foggy sky though. 7.', '2007-01-02 10:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170025, 443279, 51538, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a place in northern China that I visited in deep mid winter long, long ago (Anshan).  Perhaps removing the colour would have made this better - as in a black and white rendition. 7.</td>', 'This reminds me of a place in northern China that I visited in deep mid winter long, long ago (Anshan).  Perhaps removing the colour would have made this better - as in a black and white rendition. 7.', '2007-01-02 10:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170028, 437503, 48797, '<td valign="top">yeah, you got my feet, hips, and arms swaying! It''s a beauty!</td>', 'yeah, you got my feet, hips, and arms swaying! It''s a beauty!', '2007-01-02 10:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170029, 442000, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and detail. 8.</td>', 'Lovely colours and detail. 8.', '2007-01-02 10:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170077, 442921, 48797, '<td valign="top">Inviting image... I am there in a dream. Splendid job!</td>', 'Inviting image... I am there in a dream. Splendid job!', '2007-01-02 10:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170113, 440712, 67707, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure and very nice catch lights in the eyes.</td>', 'Nice exposure and very nice catch lights in the eyes.', '2007-01-02 10:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170124, 444353, 48797, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Portrait! This young lady is shining from the heart!</td>', 'Beautiful Portrait! This young lady is shining from the heart!', '2007-01-02 11:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170170, 444198, 66353, '<td valign="top">Maybe a tiny bit oversharpened - but still a wonderful picture. Amazing colours and detail and definately in my top 10 in the challenge.</td>', 'Maybe a tiny bit oversharpened - but still a wonderful picture. Amazing colours and detail and definately in my top 10 in the challenge.', '2007-01-02 11:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170178, 441977, 66353, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...<br/>Colours and composition are spot on - and the light reflection in the drop adds the finishing touch to a very nice picture.</td>', 'Beautiful...Colours and composition are spot on - and the light reflection in the drop adds the finishing touch to a very nice picture.', '2007-01-02 11:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170183, 445217, 66353, '<td valign="top">Nothing new here - it''s been done a million times before...<br/>But, this is still in my top 10 in the challenge because you''ve done it so very well. Amazing detail and fantastic colours. Great shot...</td>', 'Nothing new here - it''s been done a million times before...But, this is still in my top 10 in the challenge because you''ve done it so very well. Amazing detail and fantastic colours. Great shot...', '2007-01-02 11:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170223, 441464, 66353, '<td valign="top">Excellent...   Best portrait in the challenge IMO.</td>', 'Excellent...   Best portrait in the challenge IMO.', '2007-01-02 11:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170244, 439816, 41794, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and Bokeh!</td>', 'Nice DOF and Bokeh!', '2007-01-02 11:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170247, 444326, 41794, '<td valign="top">I like how you incorporated the single set of footprints leading to person standing by the water.</td>', 'I like how you incorporated the single set of footprints leading to person standing by the water.', '2007-01-02 11:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170324, 445392, 30608, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!</td>', 'What a cutie!', '2007-01-02 11:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170357, 441560, 6999, '<td valign="top">A remarkable scene, though i think you''ve perhaps over-exposed it, or perhaps rather not brought the overall brightness completely under control in processing - more dark to balance the brightness would help the impact of the shot.</td>', 'A remarkable scene, though i think you''ve perhaps over-exposed it, or perhaps rather not brought the overall brightness completely under control in processing - more dark to balance the brightness would help the impact of the shot.', '2007-01-02 11:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170373, 445141, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fine image of the power of the animal - and perhaps the best mid-stride pose one can get, showing the full extension. I''d perhaps have preferred the exposure a little under this point - the whites are just blown, and and easing of the overall sense of brightness might give more tonal balance to the whole image.</td>', 'Fine image of the power of the animal - and perhaps the best mid-stride pose one can get, showing the full extension. I''d perhaps have preferred the exposure a little under this point - the whites are just blown, and and easing of the overall sense of brightness might give more tonal balance to the whole image.', '2007-01-02 11:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170375, 445329, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the light flares and the rich blue and gold. Great leading line too.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the light flares and the rich blue and gold. Great leading line too.', '2007-01-02 11:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170382, 445353, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is interesting and quite different.  The focus is amazing. It doesn''t have the wow factor some might want, but it is very artful and unique. 7</td>', 'This is interesting and quite different.  The focus is amazing. It doesn''t have the wow factor some might want, but it is very artful and unique. 7', '2007-01-02 11:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170387, 443485, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, solid composition, good processing other than perhaps allowing the brightest part of the sky to go too far in the white - I appreciate the difficulty though. I wonder if you shot this RAW, and if you might have mixed a couple of exposures to calm down that extreme brightness ...</td>', 'Nice shot, solid composition, good processing other than perhaps allowing the brightest part of the sky to go too far in the white - I appreciate the difficulty though. I wonder if you shot this RAW, and if you might have mixed a couple of exposures to calm down that extreme brightness ...', '2007-01-02 11:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170389, 443715, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is quite lovely. I love the "stripes" on the mountains.  It''s simple. A classic.</td>', 'This is quite lovely. I love the "stripes" on the mountains.  It''s simple. A classic.', '2007-01-02 11:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170399, 444297, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful DOF and bokeh. I nice change from babies and Christmas pictures.  I can see this in a high end magazine.  Nice work. 8</td>', 'Beautiful DOF and bokeh. I nice change from babies and Christmas pictures.  I can see this in a high end magazine.  Nice work. 8', '2007-01-02 11:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170401, 439682, 6999, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the lines breaking the border - especially the choice of an out-of-focus one to do it with: seems gratuitous and strange, and takes away from the photographic nature of the image and makes it about the framing of the presentation rather than the photograph.</td>', 'Don''t like the lines breaking the border - especially the choice of an out-of-focus one to do it with: seems gratuitous and strange, and takes away from the photographic nature of the image and makes it about the framing of the presentation rather than the photograph.', '2007-01-02 11:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170406, 440750, 15711, '<td valign="top">As much as I try not to love seascapes and sunsets, man, this is jut beautiful. The rich tones and the wonderful perspective. Great use of the portrait orientation as well. Good job.</td>', 'As much as I try not to love seascapes and sunsets, man, this is jut beautiful. The rich tones and the wonderful perspective. Great use of the portrait orientation as well. Good job.', '2007-01-02 11:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170411, 440652, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting.  Her eyes are captivating. Nice job.</td>', 'Lovely lighting.  Her eyes are captivating. Nice job.', '2007-01-02 11:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170418, 445169, 6999, '<td valign="top">The sharpness of the figure and the softness of other elements at the same distance gives this a strange non-photographic feeling: almost suggesting that you weren''t confident of the composition alone to make your point. With thos background figures I can understand why. Tonality is good, although for me I would perhaps have preferred a slightly stronger contrast.</td>', 'The sharpness of the figure and the softness of other elements at the same distance gives this a strange non-photographic feeling: almost suggesting that you weren''t confident of the composition alone to make your point. With thos background figures I can understand why. Tonality is good, although for me I would perhaps have preferred a slightly stronger contrast.', '2007-01-02 12:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170426, 443967, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the softness and color palette. Maybe a touch too soft, but pretty nonetheless.</td>', 'I like the softness and color palette. Maybe a touch too soft, but pretty nonetheless.', '2007-01-02 12:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170427, 441800, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great image - especially the umbrella. Processing is good too - and naturally, black and white is perfect for it. The package and the brolly make a nice adult vs childhood point. I like this.</td>', 'Great image - especially the umbrella. Processing is good too - and naturally, black and white is perfect for it. The package and the brolly make a nice adult vs childhood point. I like this.', '2007-01-02 12:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170429, 442551, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice smile.  Seems a touch overdone on the skin with possibly Neat image? She''s lovely.</td>', 'Nice smile.  Seems a touch overdone on the skin with possibly Neat image? She''s lovely.', '2007-01-02 12:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170438, 444934, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oh that you might have moved your viewpoint to move the moon''s reflection away from the boards ... or to hide it completely. A nice still image, but the over-exposure of the moon, and the ghosting of it, and, again, that reflection rather spoil the simplicity of it for me.</td>', 'Oh that you might have moved your viewpoint to move the moon''s reflection away from the boards ... or to hide it completely. A nice still image, but the over-exposure of the moon, and the ghosting of it, and, again, that reflection rather spoil the simplicity of it for me.', '2007-01-02 12:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170441, 442592, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love oversaturated colors, but this is a bit much for my taste. I think it would make a great study in black and white with the varying degrees of contrast here. The composition is good.</td>', 'I love oversaturated colors, but this is a bit much for my taste. I think it would make a great study in black and white with the varying degrees of contrast here. The composition is good.', '2007-01-02 12:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170462, 445058, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good capture of light, but I feel it might have been done with a touch more care. The composition is fine, and the balance of the direct and reflected light is as good as could be wished for, but there''s a sense of a tilt to the image - real or imagined, it''s enough to upset the eye, and there''s a sense of lack of detail in some areas without the single area of perfect sharpness to make a point.</td>', 'Good capture of light, but I feel it might have been done with a touch more care. The composition is fine, and the balance of the direct and reflected light is as good as could be wished for, but there''s a sense of a tilt to the image - real or imagined, it''s enough to upset the eye, and there''s a sense of lack of detail in some areas without the single area of perfect sharpness to make a point.', '2007-01-02 12:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170465, 444596, 52713, '<td valign="top">Hi Larus!</td>', 'Hi Larus!', '2007-01-02 12:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170475, 445354, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice moment - a little contrast work might have been more sympathetic to the skin tones, which seem overly pale and washed out here.</td>', 'Nice moment - a little contrast work might have been more sympathetic to the skin tones, which seem overly pale and washed out here.', '2007-01-02 12:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170491, 442655, 52713, '<td valign="top">I like it! I would have bumped up the blues inthe water in sky since this was advanced editing. 6</td>', 'I like it! I would have bumped up the blues inthe water in sky since this was advanced editing. 6', '2007-01-02 12:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170503, 444569, 63164, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, amazing picture</td>', 'Beautiful, amazing picture', '2007-01-02 12:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170512, 445121, 6999, '<td valign="top">The foreground posts kind of confuse the composition - though i can see your thinking with the road. There''s a strange lack of clarity to the whole presentation - slightly noisy, and lacking real fine detail: that could be a number of things, like under-exposure, simple lack of resolution, processing problems. The shot overall, I think, could do with more punch in the tonality - taking the bright points further towards white, whereas they tend to grey here. Also, the house is perhaps too far out of frame for a strong composition, feeling a bit crowded toward the right edge. It has potential I''d say, but i don''t think you''ve really managed to bring it out.</td>', 'The foreground posts kind of confuse the composition - though i can see your thinking with the road. There''s a strange lack of clarity to the whole presentation - slightly noisy, and lacking real fine detail: that could be a number of things, like under-exposure, simple lack of resolution, processing problems. The shot overall, I think, could do with more punch in the tonality - taking the bright points further towards white, whereas they tend to grey here. Also, the house is perhaps too far out of frame for a strong composition, feeling a bit crowded toward the right edge. It has potential I''d say, but i don''t think you''ve really managed to bring it out.', '2007-01-02 12:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170522, 444994, 63164, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, so natural and not posed</td>', 'I like this picture, so natural and not posed', '2007-01-02 12:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170532, 445142, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting, arresting, full of implications and intimations. <i>Timor mortis conturbat me ...</i> Has the look of a child, and the number has implications from all over the place. I hope it''s slightly happier than one suspects. One of very few images where a simple documentary style is precisely what is required. Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Interesting, arresting, full of implications and intimations. Timor mortis conturbat me ... Has the look of a child, and the number has implications from all over the place. I hope it''s slightly happier than one suspects. One of very few images where a simple documentary style is precisely what is required. Thanks for sharing.', '2007-01-02 12:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170536, 445158, 65603, '<td valign="top">I like the picture from the wrist up. She has a pretty smile very relaxed. Also with the hat being b&amp;w a pink background I think would make it "pop," as well as add a touch more feminine touch.</td>', 'I like the picture from the wrist up. She has a pretty smile very relaxed. Also with the hat being b&w a pink background I think would make it "pop," as well as add a touch more feminine touch.', '2007-01-02 12:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170559, 442455, 49109, '<td valign="top">good crop, nice lighting, just wish there was more detail in the foreground</td>', 'good crop, nice lighting, just wish there was more detail in the foreground', '2007-01-02 12:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170577, 445141, 49109, '<td valign="top">great sto-motion, perfect sharp, well done</td>', 'great sto-motion, perfect sharp, well done', '2007-01-02 12:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170682, 439124, 68688, '<td valign="top">Very nice I like it</td>', 'Very nice I like it', '2007-01-02 12:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170754, 444635, 15204, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF and the bokeh from the Christmas light at the bottom of the frame.  I find that the white spot of light coming through the branches competes with the ornament for my attention.  A nice Christmas shot! 6</td>', 'I like the DOF and the bokeh from the Christmas light at the bottom of the frame.  I find that the white spot of light coming through the branches competes with the ornament for my attention.  A nice Christmas shot! 6', '2007-01-02 12:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170767, 438310, 66193, '<td valign="top">would''ve scored better (IMO) without the perspective caused by the wide angle lens.  your horizon is very tilted (look near Ledge Light).  And your Eastern Point Light is not vertical either.  Probably would have been better with the entire lighthouse in the frame too (it looks chopped off here).  The colors are fantastic, though, and I like the star burst pattern from the sun.</td>', 'would''ve scored better (IMO) without the perspective caused by the wide angle lens.  your horizon is very tilted (look near Ledge Light).  And your Eastern Point Light is not vertical either.  Probably would have been better with the entire lighthouse in the frame too (it looks chopped off here).  The colors are fantastic, though, and I like the star burst pattern from the sun.', '2007-01-02 13:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170770, 444208, 15204, '<td valign="top">I understand all about the pacifier!  A very nice shot of this adorable little one.  Although she is turned into the shade and mostly side-lit, you got catchlights in her eyes which really helps them sparkle.  COmpositionally, she is very centered and I feel like her arms are chopped a little awkwardly.  I think I would either crop it looser with more arms at the bottom of the frame and have her off-center to the left, or crop in even tighter so the image is really just her face.  This crop/composition seems sort of ''in between''.  What a cutie!</td>', 'I understand all about the pacifier!  A very nice shot of this adorable little one.  Although she is turned into the shade and mostly side-lit, you got catchlights in her eyes which really helps them sparkle.  COmpositionally, she is very centered and I feel like her arms are chopped a little awkwardly.  I think I would either crop it looser with more arms at the bottom of the frame and have her off-center to the left, or crop in even tighter so the image is really just her face.  This crop/composition seems sort of ''in between''.  What a cutie!', '2007-01-02 13:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170832, 444934, 64929, '<td valign="top">The picture is enchanting...the only thing that distracts me is the moon (glare,double appearance, and harshness on the deck)</td>', 'The picture is enchanting...the only thing that distracts me is the moon (glare,double appearance, and harshness on the deck)', '2007-01-02 13:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170834, 445166, 45115, '<td valign="top">excellent composition! Love the tones!</td>', 'excellent composition! Love the tones!', '2007-01-02 13:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170836, 444709, 2612, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and great timing to get the right blue in the sky and the right reflections.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and great timing to get the right blue in the sky and the right reflections.', '2007-01-02 13:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170839, 444198, 64929, '<td valign="top">Very nice!!  I love bird pictures and this one is exceptional! &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Very nice!!  I love bird pictures and this one is exceptional! <9>', '2007-01-02 13:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170848, 445331, 2612, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait. I do have one comment on the lighting... the shadow to the left of the frame seems to add weight, from a composition standpoint, behind the subjects. Maybe a little light on the background to balance that would help. Of course this is just an opinion.... thanks for sharing the image.</td>', 'Excellent portrait. I do have one comment on the lighting... the shadow to the left of the frame seems to add weight, from a composition standpoint, behind the subjects. Maybe a little light on the background to balance that would help. Of course this is just an opinion.... thanks for sharing the image.', '2007-01-02 13:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170850, 443890, 45115, '<td valign="top">excellent framming here! This should do well in the challenge!</td>', 'excellent framming here! This should do well in the challenge!', '2007-01-02 13:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170851, 443037, 12200, '<td valign="top">I would play with the contrast and saturation of this one more. Might even try black and white...it''s just a little to drab for me to give this one higher than a 3 for THIS challenge (which is a really tough one, by the way).</td>', 'I would play with the contrast and saturation of this one more. Might even try black and white...it''s just a little to drab for me to give this one higher than a 3 for THIS challenge (which is a really tough one, by the way).', '2007-01-02 13:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170852, 444768, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong technically - detail and exposure are flawless. I remain unconvinced about the pink collar - show more of it or lose it completely I don''t know, but with just occasional hints of it it perhaps becomes distracting. If it were my pet i''d be delighted with your work.</td>', 'Strong technically - detail and exposure are flawless. I remain unconvinced about the pink collar - show more of it or lose it completely I don''t know, but with just occasional hints of it it perhaps becomes distracting. If it were my pet i''d be delighted with your work.', '2007-01-02 13:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170853, 444959, 12200, '<td valign="top">Close, but not quite...it''s too grainy for me.</td>', 'Close, but not quite...it''s too grainy for me.', '2007-01-02 13:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170855, 445353, 45115, '<td valign="top">excellent shot pedro! very creative as always! this should do well in the challenge! 7</td>', 'excellent shot pedro! very creative as always! this should do well in the challenge! 7', '2007-01-02 13:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170859, 441690, 64929, '<td valign="top">Outstanding! &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Outstanding! <9>', '2007-01-02 13:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170860, 445163, 6999, '<td valign="top">It seems an odd decision to shoot this not-quite-centred, and not quite from directly above. It''s the ''quite'' that''s the problem - it''s so nearly from directly above, and so nearly centred that I don''t see what you gain, whilst losing the graphic strangeness that the directly above shot would surely have. You do have a great tonality in the edge of the tea, but would you have lost that from above? Don''t know, but this seems neither one thing nor another.</td>', 'It seems an odd decision to shoot this not-quite-centred, and not quite from directly above. It''s the ''quite'' that''s the problem - it''s so nearly from directly above, and so nearly centred that I don''t see what you gain, whilst losing the graphic strangeness that the directly above shot would surely have. You do have a great tonality in the edge of the tea, but would you have lost that from above? Don''t know, but this seems neither one thing nor another.', '2007-01-02 13:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170861, 437887, 45115, '<td valign="top">sounds like a wonderful place! 6</td>', 'sounds like a wonderful place! 6', '2007-01-02 13:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170872, 444217, 45115, '<td valign="top">this could have been a wonderful picture if the subject in the center wasn''t blurry... also the picture is a bit too soft? Just my opinion...<br/>The crop on the left and right faces work well.</td>', 'this could have been a wonderful picture if the subject in the center wasn''t blurry... also the picture is a bit too soft? Just my opinion...The crop on the left and right faces work well.', '2007-01-02 13:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170874, 444343, 6999, '<td valign="top">In a scene so full of textures, and without much interesting colour this should surely have been black and white? You''ve done well in this light to keep detail in the face without over-doing everything else too much. The dog''s gaze takes the eye out of frame, which is a pity - it would cry out for waiting for the moment when the dog looks at the bloke, really; maybe that wasn''t an opportunity, but it still detracts from the coherence of the image.</td>', 'In a scene so full of textures, and without much interesting colour this should surely have been black and white? You''ve done well in this light to keep detail in the face without over-doing everything else too much. The dog''s gaze takes the eye out of frame, which is a pity - it would cry out for waiting for the moment when the dog looks at the bloke, really; maybe that wasn''t an opportunity, but it still detracts from the coherence of the image.', '2007-01-02 13:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170878, 445157, 45115, '<td valign="top">shame the pic is blurry... could have been scorin really high!</td>', 'shame the pic is blurry... could have been scorin really high!', '2007-01-02 13:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170882, 439846, 6999, '<td valign="top">Without being a great follower of his stuff, I''d still have to say this was Robert''s. It bears (forgive pun) the hallmarks of the HDR, and the compositional sense, and the flat-landscape. Fine work, as usual. I wish i could get more excited about landscapes these days ...</td>', 'Without being a great follower of his stuff, I''d still have to say this was Robert''s. It bears (forgive pun) the hallmarks of the HDR, and the compositional sense, and the flat-landscape. Fine work, as usual. I wish i could get more excited about landscapes these days ...', '2007-01-02 13:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170883, 443811, 2612, '<td valign="top">Excellent work! <br/>+ The exposure and tonality across her face and chest is wonderful.<br/>+ The eyes are well lit even though her right eye is slightly shadowed.<br/>+ Subtle but nice lighting on the background to give separation.<br/>- The only slight minus... and I had too long a long time to find anything... is the sharp transition from light to shadow where her left wrist is bent. A little abrupt for an image with such smooth transitions.... but so minor I wouldn''t have mentioned except to show how well done the overall image is.</td>', 'Excellent work! + The exposure and tonality across her face and chest is wonderful.+ The eyes are well lit even though her right eye is slightly shadowed.+ Subtle but nice lighting on the background to give separation.- The only slight minus... and I had too long a long time to find anything... is the sharp transition from light to shadow where her left wrist is bent. A little abrupt for an image with such smooth transitions.... but so minor I wouldn''t have mentioned except to show how well done the overall image is.', '2007-01-02 13:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170885, 437503, 12200, '<td valign="top">I love the riverwalk at Christmastime! This is a very nice shot, but it suffers severely from an overwhelming amout of "busy-ness." I can''t quite explain it, other than to say that I find myself weary of looking at it after only a little while. Perhaps the color is just TOO vivid in this one for me, or maybe it could use a softer focus? I don''t know. I offer a 5.</td>', 'I love the riverwalk at Christmastime! This is a very nice shot, but it suffers severely from an overwhelming amout of "busy-ness." I can''t quite explain it, other than to say that I find myself weary of looking at it after only a little while. Perhaps the color is just TOO vivid in this one for me, or maybe it could use a softer focus? I don''t know. I offer a 5.', '2007-01-02 13:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170886, 440863, 6999, '<td valign="top">A thousand comments, no doubt ;-) Perhaps, you kneed a closer crop?</td>', 'A thousand comments, no doubt ;-) Perhaps, you kneed a closer crop?', '2007-01-02 13:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170890, 442692, 12200, '<td valign="top">The trees are gorgeous...but the angel feels a little "out of place" and ill-focused.</td>', 'The trees are gorgeous...but the angel feels a little "out of place" and ill-focused.', '2007-01-02 13:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170898, 442549, 6999, '<td valign="top">Impressive - exposure is spot on, though these days perhaps that''s less impressive than it once was. Suspicion of some heavy-handed darkening of sky, but overall good use of weirdness of lens in producing this image.</td>', 'Impressive - exposure is spot on, though these days perhaps that''s less impressive than it once was. Suspicion of some heavy-handed darkening of sky, but overall good use of weirdness of lens in producing this image.', '2007-01-02 13:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170903, 443935, 6999, '<td valign="top">Neat work. Does it really need the lights at each side of frame? I can see why the answer might be yes, but they seem to lead to a distortion of composition, being not quite equi-distant from the memorial.</td>', 'Neat work. Does it really need the lights at each side of frame? I can see why the answer might be yes, but they seem to lead to a distortion of composition, being not quite equi-distant from the memorial.', '2007-01-02 13:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170904, 444973, 12200, '<td valign="top">A very nice candid, for sure. There''s something about this shot that feels unfocus, or unconvincing to me, though. Perhaps greater contrast? Gradient? I''m not sure...but I still thinks its a very solid 6.</td>', 'A very nice candid, for sure. There''s something about this shot that feels unfocus, or unconvincing to me, though. Perhaps greater contrast? Gradient? I''m not sure...but I still thinks its a very solid 6.', '2007-01-02 13:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170912, 440847, 12200, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame this one couldn''t have been saved for the Fireworks II challenge. It''s gorgeous.</td>', 'It''s a shame this one couldn''t have been saved for the Fireworks II challenge. It''s gorgeous.', '2007-01-02 13:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170917, 439523, 6999, '<td valign="top">The difficulty with the DPC background shade is that it''s actually quite bright - soa  high-key shot, as snow inevitably is, sometimes requires something to separate it from that background. Here, although your exposure is perfect, nevertheless many of the broad field tones of your image are very close to that shade. It''s one example of a situation where I think some kind of border would serve you well to maintain the integrity of the image against that field of grey. Nice picture, but a bit twee for my taste.</td>', 'The difficulty with the DPC background shade is that it''s actually quite bright - soa  high-key shot, as snow inevitably is, sometimes requires something to separate it from that background. Here, although your exposure is perfect, nevertheless many of the broad field tones of your image are very close to that shade. It''s one example of a situation where I think some kind of border would serve you well to maintain the integrity of the image against that field of grey. Nice picture, but a bit twee for my taste.', '2007-01-02 13:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170918, 443454, 12200, '<td valign="top">WAY WAY too light. I had to tilt my monitor to even see that there was anything there.</td>', 'WAY WAY too light. I had to tilt my monitor to even see that there was anything there.', '2007-01-02 13:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170919, 444565, 64929, '<td valign="top">Great capture but lose the frame and resize the picture larger, in my opinion</td>', 'Great capture but lose the frame and resize the picture larger, in my opinion', '2007-01-02 13:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170926, 445108, 6999, '<td valign="top">Glad of your title - might have missed it otherwise. Can''t help the feeling that you might have made more of the textural variation and tonality of those pilings, and even emphasised the silhouette of the boat.</td>', 'Glad of your title - might have missed it otherwise. Can''t help the feeling that you might have made more of the textural variation and tonality of those pilings, and even emphasised the silhouette of the boat.', '2007-01-02 13:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170931, 441813, 64929, '<td valign="top">great capture but a little too close of cropping, IMHO</td>', 'great capture but a little too close of cropping, IMHO', '2007-01-02 13:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170934, 440712, 15204, '<td valign="top">A beautiful portrait.  Her eyes are wonderful and, for me, the focal point of the image.  Nice catchlights.   I think the scarf works very nicely, and adds leading lines to her face.  The line of the open zipper I feel is a little disctracting and competes with the subject for my attention.  I like your black and white conversion.  It can be hard to do a nice conversion of a fair-skinned person in fairly flat outdoor light, and this is really nicelt done.</td>', 'A beautiful portrait.  Her eyes are wonderful and, for me, the focal point of the image.  Nice catchlights.   I think the scarf works very nicely, and adds leading lines to her face.  The line of the open zipper I feel is a little disctracting and competes with the subject for my attention.  I like your black and white conversion.  It can be hard to do a nice conversion of a fair-skinned person in fairly flat outdoor light, and this is really nicelt done.', '2007-01-02 13:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170943, 442921, 6999, '<td valign="top">The processing or light here is very strange - the patches of brightness seem to bear little relevance to the visible sources of light, and one would suspect that they''re added in processing. That, and the odd levels of shadow versus highlights make overall, for me, for a very unappealing image - processing running out of control, rather than photography.</td>', 'The processing or light here is very strange - the patches of brightness seem to bear little relevance to the visible sources of light, and one would suspect that they''re added in processing. That, and the odd levels of shadow versus highlights make overall, for me, for a very unappealing image - processing running out of control, rather than photography.', '2007-01-02 13:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170945, 443391, 12200, '<td valign="top">What fascinating architecture!</td>', 'What fascinating architecture!', '2007-01-02 13:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170950, 435031, 12200, '<td valign="top">I think the angling on this one is a bit too much for this shot...maybe 35 degrees or so?</td>', 'I think the angling on this one is a bit too much for this shot...maybe 35 degrees or so?', '2007-01-02 13:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170952, 436538, 12200, '<td valign="top">I wonder if Jesse would use this as a promotional poster? It looks like that''s what the shot would have been for...or maybe album art?</td>', 'I wonder if Jesse would use this as a promotional poster? It looks like that''s what the shot would have been for...or maybe album art?', '2007-01-02 14:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170956, 444610, 12200, '<td valign="top">The border color seems off on this one...Maybe the darker tone of blue in the jacket?</td>', 'The border color seems off on this one...Maybe the darker tone of blue in the jacket?', '2007-01-02 14:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170958, 445197, 6999, '<td valign="top">The very sudden progression of light in the sky seems unreal. I quite like the composition, you''ve had the sense to make the most of that sky, and yet maintain enough balance in the amount of landscape.</td>', 'The very sudden progression of light in the sky seems unreal. I quite like the composition, you''ve had the sense to make the most of that sky, and yet maintain enough balance in the amount of landscape.', '2007-01-02 14:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170964, 434677, 6999, '<td valign="top">In such a parade of lookalike pretty images, it''s refreshing to find something plain weird. Not to say that I particularly like it - it strikes me as slightly disingenuous - but it remains refreshing. Thankyou.</td>', 'In such a parade of lookalike pretty images, it''s refreshing to find something plain weird. Not to say that I particularly like it - it strikes me as slightly disingenuous - but it remains refreshing. Thankyou.', '2007-01-02 14:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170968, 445382, 12200, '<td valign="top">This is such a gorgeous shot. I think the border actually detracts from it, somehow...I think perhaps a lightly blurred or softened edge...maybe a burned one...would have been a better choice. But I still rate this a solid 9.</td>', 'This is such a gorgeous shot. I think the border actually detracts from it, somehow...I think perhaps a lightly blurred or softened edge...maybe a burned one...would have been a better choice. But I still rate this a solid 9.', '2007-01-02 14:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170975, 435454, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fine landscape - perhaps could use a touch - just a touch mind - of contrast work in the foreground - it has a slight flatness.</td>', 'Fine landscape - perhaps could use a touch - just a touch mind - of contrast work in the foreground - it has a slight flatness.', '2007-01-02 14:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170986, 444511, 6999, '<td valign="top">Intriguing light here. I like the simplicity of your composition, and the humdrum element of the inclusion of that bench; I think it perhaps lacks a touch of real interest for me - either human or graphical.</td>', 'Intriguing light here. I like the simplicity of your composition, and the humdrum element of the inclusion of that bench; I think it perhaps lacks a touch of real interest for me - either human or graphical.', '2007-01-02 14:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3170994, 445074, 6999, '<td valign="top">It''s a proper instrument, the button accordion - there are things you can play on one of those that you can''t play on anything else. I don''t think this is a great photograph - it''s OK, but it lacks the elements that would make it more than a simple illustration of an instrument.</td>', 'It''s a proper instrument, the button accordion - there are things you can play on one of those that you can''t play on anything else. I don''t think this is a great photograph - it''s OK, but it lacks the elements that would make it more than a simple illustration of an instrument.', '2007-01-02 14:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171005, 439126, 12200, '<td valign="top">The clarity of this shot is lovely.</td>', 'The clarity of this shot is lovely.', '2007-01-02 14:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171011, 444399, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good detail, good strong colours, exposure is fine. I''d perhaps hope for a touch more spark compositionally - this seems just a touch straightforward, which makes it a not-quite image for me: there''s a sense of not really knowing what your real point of concentration is here - the coats, the smoke, he decoration, the flasks and bags? Too many elements competing for attention perhaps.</td>', 'Good detail, good strong colours, exposure is fine. I''d perhaps hope for a touch more spark compositionally - this seems just a touch straightforward, which makes it a not-quite image for me: there''s a sense of not really knowing what your real point of concentration is here - the coats, the smoke, he decoration, the flasks and bags? Too many elements competing for attention perhaps.', '2007-01-02 14:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171042, 439124, 41794, '<td valign="top">Wow...I love the mood that this photo sets! The rich earth tone is a nice contrast to the gray fog.</td>', 'Wow...I love the mood that this photo sets! The rich earth tone is a nice contrast to the gray fog.', '2007-01-02 14:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171043, 445213, 59078, '<td valign="top">the colors are pretty distinct... i like that!-!!</td>', 'the colors are pretty distinct... i like that!-!!', '2007-01-02 14:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171066, 434379, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of decay here - like a winter return to a summer home, on a quiet day.</td>', 'I like the sense of decay here - like a winter return to a summer home, on a quiet day.', '2007-01-02 14:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171093, 443454, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - think I might even have taken things a touch further - really keep it in the realm of the subliminal.</td>', 'Nice idea - think I might even have taken things a touch further - really keep it in the realm of the subliminal.', '2007-01-02 14:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171102, 439028, 31443, '<td valign="top">Oh dear, probably still in nappies, just started to walk and I don''t know how to use my cellphone properly! What a cute guy! Beautiful portrait!</td>', 'Oh dear, probably still in nappies, just started to walk and I don''t know how to use my cellphone properly! What a cute guy! Beautiful portrait!', '2007-01-02 14:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171105, 438455, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice groove, but slightly let down by some confusion in some areas. certainly has a sense of moment though, which is important.</td>', 'Nice groove, but slightly let down by some confusion in some areas. certainly has a sense of moment though, which is important.', '2007-01-02 14:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171110, 434059, 6999, '<td valign="top">The silhouette skyline in sunset images becomes the second most important thing after, of course, the sky itself. Here I feel it lets your image down a little - its kind of confused and not particularly interesting.</td>', 'The silhouette skyline in sunset images becomes the second most important thing after, of course, the sky itself. Here I feel it lets your image down a little - its kind of confused and not particularly interesting.', '2007-01-02 14:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
