(3171221, 445027, 7628, '<td valign="top">I love the drama of this photo - the line of the rail running along the bottom, the stars and clouds floating etheral above.  However the way you have exposed it is too dark for my tastes.  I would prefer to lighten the image - bring out some of the contrasts and colors - I lightened the shadows using shadows/highlights, boosted the yellow and red colors a bit in Hue/saturation, and tweeked the exposure in curves.  I also reduced noise with noise ninja.  I don''t know what you''ll think, but I like the results better...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=446384" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7628/thumb/446384.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7628/thumb/446384.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7628/thumb/446384.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I love the drama of this photo - the line of the rail running along the bottom, the stars and clouds floating etheral above.  However the way you have exposed it is too dark for my tastes.  I would prefer to lighten the image - bring out some of the contrasts and colors - I lightened the shadows using shadows/highlights, boosted the yellow and red colors a bit in Hue/saturation, and tweeked the exposure in curves.  I also reduced noise with noise ninja.  I don''t know what you''ll think, but I like the results better... ', '2007-01-02 15:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171266, 439869, 13958, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to make of this photo. Give you a neutral 5</td>', 'Not sure what to make of this photo. Give you a neutral 5', '2007-01-02 15:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
