(3171277, 445211, 7628, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the expression you''ve captured here - this is a Llama with personality and a high opinion of himself.  Your title reflects that - he does have a lovely eye.  However I think the color cast of the photo is too green.  With some adjustments in photoshop using hue/saturation or color adjust, you can get a more natural light and even highlight the blue of the eye - see what you think:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=446391" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7628/thumb/446391.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7628/thumb/446391.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7628/thumb/446391.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I enjoy the expression you''ve captured here - this is a Llama with personality and a high opinion of himself.  Your title reflects that - he does have a lovely eye.  However I think the color cast of the photo is too green.  With some adjustments in photoshop using hue/saturation or color adjust, you can get a more natural light and even highlight the blue of the eye - see what you think:', '2007-01-02 15:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
