(3171730, 442258, 12200, '<td valign="top">It looks like there might have been moisture on the lens when this was taken. The splotches in the upper right and lower right hand corners are very distracting to me. A skilled Photoshop regimen might be able to eliminate these blemishes from an otherwise finely-executed composition.</td>', 'It looks like there might have been moisture on the lens when this was taken. The splotches in the upper right and lower right hand corners are very distracting to me. A skilled Photoshop regimen might be able to eliminate these blemishes from an otherwise finely-executed composition.', '2007-01-02 17:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
