(3171741, 445132, 13958, '<td valign="top">If a storm is comming, you must have used a very fast shutter speed to get no motion in the long grass. Although you have good DOF you seem to have lost some sharpness.   6</td>', 'If a storm is comming, you must have used a very fast shutter speed to get no motion in the long grass. Although you have good DOF you seem to have lost some sharpness.   6', '2007-01-02 17:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171742, 445229, 12200, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, but I am unfond of the coloration of the background cityscape. Something that would be really effective on a shot like this (post-challenge, of course) might be to try two-toning the background and the water and leaving the boat itself (which would be pretty easy to select with a lasso tool and some patience) in its rich blue color. If you try that sometime, email me the result. I''d love to see.</td>', 'I love the composition, but I am unfond of the coloration of the background cityscape. Something that would be really effective on a shot like this (post-challenge, of course) might be to try two-toning the background and the water and leaving the boat itself (which would be pretty easy to select with a lasso tool and some patience) in its rich blue color. If you try that sometime, email me the result. I''d love to see.', '2007-01-02 17:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
