(3171781, 444726, 12200, '<td valign="top">This piece is too blue (and hence too monotonous) for me. Personally (and feel free to disagree) when I have a shot like this that is so close to being two tones already (in this case blues and whites), I like to just go ahead and make it do what it''s trying to do using a monochrome or sepia range effect, and then play with the contrast and lighting. I think that just might be the thing to push this one over the top. I offer a 6.</td>', 'This piece is too blue (and hence too monotonous) for me. Personally (and feel free to disagree) when I have a shot like this that is so close to being two tones already (in this case blues and whites), I like to just go ahead and make it do what it''s trying to do using a monochrome or sepia range effect, and then play with the contrast and lighting. I think that just might be the thing to push this one over the top. I offer a 6.', '2007-01-02 17:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171799, 444128, 22046, '<td valign="top">The background is distracting here. I think it would work better if you cropped down so the focus was on his hands and face. Interesting subject.</td>', 'The background is distracting here. I think it would work better if you cropped down so the focus was on his hands and face. Interesting subject.', '2007-01-02 17:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
