(3171962, 445156, 59415, '<td valign="top">I am not a huge fan of the crop of this image.  So many parts with so much detail are scattered throughout the frame making it hard to really focus on the subject.  If I were to guess it would be the dolls face, and if that is the case I would like to see the dolls face in a diffrent way.  The tone of the image does however really give it an old time (50''sish) look that is kind of neat.  It is like old film.</td>', 'I am not a huge fan of the crop of this image.  So many parts with so much detail are scattered throughout the frame making it hard to really focus on the subject.  If I were to guess it would be the dolls face, and if that is the case I would like to see the dolls face in a diffrent way.  The tone of the image does however really give it an old time (50''sish) look that is kind of neat.  It is like old film.', '2007-01-02 18:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
