(3171972, 444621, 59415, '<td valign="top">Very nice tourquois(sp) water.  It almost doesn''t look natural.  I like the way the birds are scattered in the frame. Very cool.</td>', 'Very nice tourquois(sp) water.  It almost doesn''t look natural.  I like the way the birds are scattered in the frame. Very cool.', '2007-01-02 18:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
