(3171974, 444775, 28532, '<td valign="top">Wow - Excellent shot - nice detail.</td>', 'Wow - Excellent shot - nice detail.', '2007-01-02 18:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171975, 441560, 12200, '<td valign="top">I love the food at Casa Rio--one of my fav''s on the Riverwalk. This shot is very festive and appealing to me, but the blurriness in certain places (e.g., the people on the boats, seated at tables in lower left, and lights on the water under the bridge) weakens this shot considerably, in my humble opinion. My camera doesn''t allow me to manually adjust shutter speeds, but I would have tried this on a tripod with a much quicker speed to try and minimize blurs. Overall, I offer a 6.</td>', 'I love the food at Casa Rio--one of my fav''s on the Riverwalk. This shot is very festive and appealing to me, but the blurriness in certain places (e.g., the people on the boats, seated at tables in lower left, and lights on the water under the bridge) weakens this shot considerably, in my humble opinion. My camera doesn''t allow me to manually adjust shutter speeds, but I would have tried this on a tripod with a much quicker speed to try and minimize blurs. Overall, I offer a 6.', '2007-01-02 18:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
