(3172069, 438868, 12200, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s only because I''m a musician myself, but for the purposes of this shot, I would really have elected to use an instrument without those hideous colored practice tape markings. They''re sooooo distracting to me. But again, maybe it''s becaue I''m a musician. Some creative cloning might be able to remove them from even this shot, which, overall, is a very solid 7 for me.</td>', 'Maybe it''s only because I''m a musician myself, but for the purposes of this shot, I would really have elected to use an instrument without those hideous colored practice tape markings. They''re sooooo distracting to me. But again, maybe it''s becaue I''m a musician. Some creative cloning might be able to remove them from even this shot, which, overall, is a very solid 7 for me.', '2007-01-02 18:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
