(3172963, 434058, 7743, '<td valign="top">Images with a lot of white/light areas tend to trick the camera''s meter to underexpose the image.  The snow appears a bit too grey and there''s not much detail in the trees.  Using the hightlight/shadow adjustment and a slight curves adjustment I think could give the image a lot more punch.</td>', 'Images with a lot of white/light areas tend to trick the camera''s meter to underexpose the image.  The snow appears a bit too grey and there''s not much detail in the trees.  Using the hightlight/shadow adjustment and a slight curves adjustment I think could give the image a lot more punch.', '2007-01-02 23:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
