(3174145, 443793, 67301, '<td valign="top">I just love this shot great focus and I love the sand in his whiskers, beautiful 10</td>', 'I just love this shot great focus and I love the sand in his whiskers, beautiful 10', '2007-01-03 06:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174146, 444612, 67301, '<td valign="top">Such a fab shot the DOF, the colour and sky are IMO a 10</td>', 'Such a fab shot the DOF, the colour and sky are IMO a 10', '2007-01-03 06:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174147, 444654, 67301, '<td valign="top">fantastic I like the hues, the focus and the action in this capture 9</td>', 'fantastic I like the hues, the focus and the action in this capture 9', '2007-01-03 06:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174148, 442692, 67301, '<td valign="top">love this shot the colour give it a sense of mystery and forboding = 9</td>', 'love this shot the colour give it a sense of mystery and forboding = 9', '2007-01-03 06:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174149, 441977, 67301, '<td valign="top">I think this shot is super sharp and I particulaly like the droplets of water<br/>= 9</td>', 'I think this shot is super sharp and I particulaly like the droplets of water= 9', '2007-01-03 06:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174150, 442634, 67301, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC SHARP ACTION SHOT, I love this = 9</td>', 'FANTASTIC SHARP ACTION SHOT, I love this = 9', '2007-01-03 06:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174151, 444775, 67301, '<td valign="top">This shot is thought provoking. A face can tell a thousand stories and I would like to know some of his.  This shot convays a hard life and IMO well worth = 9</td>', 'This shot is thought provoking. A face can tell a thousand stories and I would like to know some of his.  This shot convays a hard life and IMO well worth = 9', '2007-01-03 06:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174152, 435842, 67301, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot the only slight critisism is a little more colour may have improved it, but IMO = 9</td>', 'beautiful shot the only slight critisism is a little more colour may have improved it, but IMO = 9', '2007-01-03 06:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174154, 435454, 67301, '<td valign="top">wow is all I can say, Its a stunning shot</td>', 'wow is all I can say, Its a stunning shot', '2007-01-03 06:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174158, 434035, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape; not sure there''s anything one would change - the dark of the stilted building works to contrast the plant thingys, and the greater composition is strong. Progression to dark at top of frame is effective too.</td>', 'Nice landscape; not sure there''s anything one would change - the dark of the stilted building works to contrast the plant thingys, and the greater composition is strong. Progression to dark at top of frame is effective too.', '2007-01-03 06:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174160, 443090, 6999, '<td valign="top">Rather like this; vignetting feels a touch imposed, rather than ''real'', but the composition is strong.</td>', 'Rather like this; vignetting feels a touch imposed, rather than ''real'', but the composition is strong.', '2007-01-03 06:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174167, 443076, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good work; the sky feels desaturated, rather than simply actually grey - there''s usually some hints of colour in a scene like this, of blues and yellows, and in a world of toned greys the pure grey seems out of place: but that''s a feeling, rather than a criticism. has a feel also of HDR work, but its well controlled.</td>', 'Good work; the sky feels desaturated, rather than simply actually grey - there''s usually some hints of colour in a scene like this, of blues and yellows, and in a world of toned greys the pure grey seems out of place: but that''s a feeling, rather than a criticism. has a feel also of HDR work, but its well controlled.', '2007-01-03 06:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174170, 443944, 52467, '<td valign="top">Awesome..Great photo, fantastic processing!</td>', 'Awesome..Great photo, fantastic processing!', '2007-01-03 06:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174171, 444643, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong sense of the granular texture of the butterfly''s wings. Great detail, but perhaps more compositional thought might have made for more impact - you''ve rather just fitted the portrait into frame, no? To give it that stand-out thing that DPC likes, it needs a touch more than this - and the leaves getting in the way will be an issue for some voters too.</td>', 'Strong sense of the granular texture of the butterfly''s wings. Great detail, but perhaps more compositional thought might have made for more impact - you''ve rather just fitted the portrait into frame, no? To give it that stand-out thing that DPC likes, it needs a touch more than this - and the leaves getting in the way will be an issue for some voters too.', '2007-01-03 06:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174173, 436119, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice groove, strong colours. Probably too close to the abstract for the voters, but a fun and interesting image.</td>', 'Nice groove, strong colours. Probably too close to the abstract for the voters, but a fun and interesting image.', '2007-01-03 06:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174176, 441231, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and processing. The bokeh is effective too. As a commercial-type portrait it would be successful, but for me I look for more compositional interest.</td>', 'Nice detail and processing. The bokeh is effective too. As a commercial-type portrait it would be successful, but for me I look for more compositional interest.', '2007-01-03 06:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174195, 442411, 21816, '<td valign="top">Thats one for somebody''s 21st!! Classic!</td>', 'Thats one for somebody''s 21st!! Classic!', '2007-01-03 06:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174210, 444621, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like the moment - I would, it has similarities with my own entry - but I must say I hate your border: it makes the tonality in the actual image difficult to assess by emphasising that colour in the image. The definition in the water is fine, but one would perhaps like more contrast around the birds, a touch more detail.</td>', 'I like the moment - I would, it has similarities with my own entry - but I must say I hate your border: it makes the tonality in the actual image difficult to assess by emphasising that colour in the image. The definition in the water is fine, but one would perhaps like more contrast around the birds, a touch more detail.', '2007-01-03 06:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174216, 444610, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fun portrait - despite the strange colour emphasis leant to it by that border colour. Personally, I''d have taken this to black and white, in which form the colours would have less impact - but the pinks and blue don''t, to my eye, bring anything to this image anyway.</td>', 'Fun portrait - despite the strange colour emphasis leant to it by that border colour. Personally, I''d have taken this to black and white, in which form the colours would have less impact - but the pinks and blue don''t, to my eye, bring anything to this image anyway.', '2007-01-03 06:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174225, 445002, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong pet portrait. Well done - despite, or perhaps because of, breaking the ''rules'' about portraits. You''ve chosen to emphasise the disappearance of his eyes behind his fur (him, her?)and that works well - it makes a point about the reality of the animal, rather than just making him her it look cute.</td>', 'Strong pet portrait. Well done - despite, or perhaps because of, breaking the ''rules'' about portraits. You''ve chosen to emphasise the disappearance of his eyes behind his fur (him, her?)and that works well - it makes a point about the reality of the animal, rather than just making him her it look cute.', '2007-01-03 06:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174229, 444990, 71114, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.</td>', 'Very nice lighting.', '2007-01-03 06:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174234, 443669, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quite nice work - lacks some punch of light, but the lines - both of her body shape and the background - make an interesting element.</td>', 'Quite nice work - lacks some punch of light, but the lines - both of her body shape and the background - make an interesting element.', '2007-01-03 06:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174242, 441526, 52467, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2007-01-03 06:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174251, 445239, 6999, '<td valign="top">Competent work, but the bottom of the image, contrasted with the upper parts of frame, becomes cluttered - the signs, the little hut, the stair rails, the trees.</td>', 'Competent work, but the bottom of the image, contrasted with the upper parts of frame, becomes cluttered - the signs, the little hut, the stair rails, the trees.', '2007-01-03 06:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174257, 444436, 6999, '<td valign="top">Pretty good work - like the sense of grain and tonality. Composition is very strong, the progression of those trees leading the eye through to the house.</td>', 'Pretty good work - like the sense of grain and tonality. Composition is very strong, the progression of those trees leading the eye through to the house.', '2007-01-03 06:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174268, 443674, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - perhaps a little lightening around the eyes would help? The obvious thing would be a catch-light, but this has a feeling of a non-studio shot. Without some sense of light in the eyes a face tends to look somewhat lifeless - but in an image that strongly suggests a hopelessness (rather than survival, resilience etc.) that''s maybe the more real approach. Doesn''t mean in won''t just take the edge off your score for many voters, though.</td>', 'Nicely done - perhaps a little lightening around the eyes would help? The obvious thing would be a catch-light, but this has a feeling of a non-studio shot. Without some sense of light in the eyes a face tends to look somewhat lifeless - but in an image that strongly suggests a hopelessness (rather than survival, resilience etc.) that''s maybe the more real approach. Doesn''t mean in won''t just take the edge off your score for many voters, though.', '2007-01-03 06:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174331, 439028, 52467, '<td valign="top">This is just adorable!</td>', 'This is just adorable!', '2007-01-03 07:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174334, 441231, 67626, '<td valign="top">Wow.. Fantastic shot!<br/>Would love to see more of her right eye.<br/>Well done!</td>', 'Wow.. Fantastic shot!Would love to see more of her right eye.Well done!', '2007-01-03 07:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174336, 440228, 67626, '<td valign="top">Clear and beautiful.<br/>Well done.</td>', 'Clear and beautiful.Well done.', '2007-01-03 07:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174385, 443811, 23458, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous girl. Nice even lighting, though there is something odd about the positioning of her legs. Could perhaps have solved that by cropping a centremetre or so from the bottom. Still, an effective image and an 8 from me.</td>', 'Gorgeous girl. Nice even lighting, though there is something odd about the positioning of her legs. Could perhaps have solved that by cropping a centremetre or so from the bottom. Still, an effective image and an 8 from me.', '2007-01-03 07:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174412, 439523, 35602, '<td valign="top">Beautiful black and white</td>', 'Beautiful black and white', '2007-01-03 08:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174417, 445299, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice detail of grain.  Subject lacks zip,though, but the birdhouse patterns from the background helps to give the image respectability.</td>', 'Nice detail of grain.  Subject lacks zip,though, but the birdhouse patterns from the background helps to give the image respectability.', '2007-01-03 08:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174418, 445211, 35602, '<td valign="top">Need more exposure.  Fill in flash would have helped to add detail, as well as better focus.</td>', 'Need more exposure.  Fill in flash would have helped to add detail, as well as better focus.', '2007-01-03 08:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174422, 443935, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice smooth shot.</td>', 'Nice smooth shot.', '2007-01-03 08:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174423, 443519, 35602, '<td valign="top">Beautful indeed.</td>', 'Beautful indeed.', '2007-01-03 08:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174427, 445246, 35602, '<td valign="top">Think that in this case the image may have done better with more shallow dof.  Your subject is overwhelmed by the background mountains.  Also, another way may have been to create a much less exposed background to make the pup really shine.</td>', 'Think that in this case the image may have done better with more shallow dof.  Your subject is overwhelmed by the background mountains.  Also, another way may have been to create a much less exposed background to make the pup really shine.', '2007-01-03 08:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174431, 445377, 35602, '<td valign="top">A lost art.  I think clearer focus on the brush and its strokes would have caused a better overall composition.</td>', 'A lost art.  I think clearer focus on the brush and its strokes would have caused a better overall composition.', '2007-01-03 08:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174436, 441231, 31341, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  However, to me, the whites of the eyes are a little overdone and take away from the image.</td>', 'Nice shot.  However, to me, the whites of the eyes are a little overdone and take away from the image.', '2007-01-03 08:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174437, 444964, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful and the colors are nicely muted.</td>', 'Very peaceful and the colors are nicely muted.', '2007-01-03 08:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174443, 445298, 35602, '<td valign="top">Too much empty space.  I know you were trying to create a perspective, but you might have left too much of the sky in.</td>', 'Too much empty space.  I know you were trying to create a perspective, but you might have left too much of the sky in.', '2007-01-03 08:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174444, 442258, 35602, '<td valign="top">I bet it looks really awesome in real life.  This one doesn''t do the snowflakes on the building edge any justice at all.</td>', 'I bet it looks really awesome in real life.  This one doesn''t do the snowflakes on the building edge any justice at all.', '2007-01-03 08:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174446, 434934, 35602, '<td valign="top">Need better focus.</td>', 'Need better focus.', '2007-01-03 08:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174447, 441783, 35602, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bit overprocesses.  Also, the sun flare is a bit heavy on the left.</td>', 'Maybe a bit overprocesses.  Also, the sun flare is a bit heavy on the left.', '2007-01-03 08:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174451, 443624, 35602, '<td valign="top">Love the title.  Color is off on the image,though.  Think it is too orangy.</td>', 'Love the title.  Color is off on the image,though.  Think it is too orangy.', '2007-01-03 08:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174454, 445157, 35602, '<td valign="top">Too soft a focus.  Priceless expression.</td>', 'Too soft a focus.  Priceless expression.', '2007-01-03 08:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174457, 435031, 35602, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the subject is.  Seems too dark.</td>', 'Not sure what the subject is.  Seems too dark.', '2007-01-03 08:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174459, 442176, 35602, '<td valign="top">Fog is difficult to capture in black and white.  The image seems too muddy.  I know low contrast is part of foggy images, but I think that the subject of the river is not a good one to depict for this type of image.  Less goes farther when doing foggy black and white scenes.</td>', 'Fog is difficult to capture in black and white.  The image seems too muddy.  I know low contrast is part of foggy images, but I think that the subject of the river is not a good one to depict for this type of image.  Less goes farther when doing foggy black and white scenes.', '2007-01-03 08:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174460, 445281, 35602, '<td valign="top">Need better exposure on the figure.</td>', 'Need better exposure on the figure.', '2007-01-03 08:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174462, 442592, 35602, '<td valign="top">Image was oversharpned on the boat, which gives it an appearance of too much separtion from the rest of the scene.</td>', 'Image was oversharpned on the boat, which gives it an appearance of too much separtion from the rest of the scene.', '2007-01-03 08:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174538, 443454, 66709, '<td valign="top">great idea  10</td>', 'great idea  10', '2007-01-03 09:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174541, 444973, 66709, '<td valign="top">awesome shot  10</td>', 'awesome shot  10', '2007-01-03 09:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174591, 444881, 66709, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2007-01-03 09:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174595, 439904, 67626, '<td valign="top">Too much noise in the sky.. <br/>Like the shadows of the tree.</td>', 'Too much noise in the sky.. Like the shadows of the tree.', '2007-01-03 09:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174611, 443630, 67626, '<td valign="top">Too small..</td>', 'Too small..', '2007-01-03 09:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174639, 437619, 66709, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2007-01-03 09:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174664, 442692, 66709, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2007-01-03 09:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174677, 438766, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition: even the coiled cable in the right hand tree echoes the circular things on the tower. It''s quite a straightforward image though, for a competition: I don''t think it has the drama to score really well, nor the absolute composition: the simplicity isn''t enough in itself, and it''s perhaps rather centred overall.</td>', 'Nice simple composition: even the coiled cable in the right hand tree echoes the circular things on the tower. It''s quite a straightforward image though, for a competition: I don''t think it has the drama to score really well, nor the absolute composition: the simplicity isn''t enough in itself, and it''s perhaps rather centred overall.', '2007-01-03 09:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174688, 444217, 6999, '<td valign="top">Has a feeling of being over-smoothed, and for me, isn''t an interesting enough composition to really strike home. I like the b/w, but in a composition that devotes everything to eyes, there isn''t enough here to really get me.</td>', 'Has a feeling of being over-smoothed, and for me, isn''t an interesting enough composition to really strike home. I like the b/w, but in a composition that devotes everything to eyes, there isn''t enough here to really get me.', '2007-01-03 09:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174695, 443073, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong dynamic composition - and very DPC at the moment. There''s interest in most areas of frame, and the leading lines function well. In the end, for me, its pretty rather than very interesting.</td>', 'Strong dynamic composition - and very DPC at the moment. There''s interest in most areas of frame, and the leading lines function well. In the end, for me, its pretty rather than very interesting.', '2007-01-03 09:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174698, 444128, 66709, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2007-01-03 09:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174700, 441800, 66709, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2007-01-03 09:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174705, 443367, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice shooting. The composition feels a little uneven to me - that lines formed by the houses is placed a bit uncomfortably high in frame: I can see your desire to maintain the reflections in shot, but I think including a bit more of the hillside - if there is more - would have balanced the frame better, and would also have made more of the incongruity of those houses nestling against the rocks. The line also leads to that house top left, which is placed rather too high in frame - and too far left perhaps - to keep the eye in frame as one scans the picture.</td>', 'Nice shooting. The composition feels a little uneven to me - that lines formed by the houses is placed a bit uncomfortably high in frame: I can see your desire to maintain the reflections in shot, but I think including a bit more of the hillside - if there is more - would have balanced the frame better, and would also have made more of the incongruity of those houses nestling against the rocks. The line also leads to that house top left, which is placed rather too high in frame - and too far left perhaps - to keep the eye in frame as one scans the picture.', '2007-01-03 09:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174711, 443270, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whether it''s your processing, or your camera, there''s a lack of real detail in these flowers. The white background seems well done, but for such a simple composition I think you need the absolute clarity of high resolution detail to make an impact.</td>', 'Whether it''s your processing, or your camera, there''s a lack of real detail in these flowers. The white background seems well done, but for such a simple composition I think you need the absolute clarity of high resolution detail to make an impact.', '2007-01-03 09:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174715, 443518, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice patterns, well caught and processed. Perhaps lacks some more formal interest for me - something more than just patterns of landscape.</td>', 'Nice patterns, well caught and processed. Perhaps lacks some more formal interest for me - something more than just patterns of landscape.', '2007-01-03 09:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3174997, 440148, 46177, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful still life with very soft wonderful colours love the composition and background, the whole thing works beautifully! Bumping up to 10</td>', 'This is a beautiful still life with very soft wonderful colours love the composition and background, the whole thing works beautifully! Bumping up to 10', '2007-01-03 10:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175040, 441476, 63604, '<td valign="top">Excellent color and flow to this photo. Nice job</td>', 'Excellent color and flow to this photo. Nice job', '2007-01-03 10:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175130, 441800, 4411, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. Nuff said.</td>', 'Brilliant. Nuff said.', '2007-01-03 11:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175186, 445357, 30608, '<td valign="top">Very nice - Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice - Good luck!', '2007-01-03 11:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175217, 435842, 30608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture!</td>', 'Beautiful capture!', '2007-01-03 11:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175237, 445393, 43869, '<td valign="top">the bg is so bright it''s blinding and it''s creating quite the hotspot on his face.  Because of the blowout you lose the actual theme "retro".  I really had to look for it.  While the angle is good,  it''s just too blown out to see what the theme really is.  Like if you hadn''t put the title "retro" I wouldn''t have looked for anything.</td>', 'the bg is so bright it''s blinding and it''s creating quite the hotspot on his face.  Because of the blowout you lose the actual theme "retro".  I really had to look for it.  While the angle is good,  it''s just too blown out to see what the theme really is.  Like if you hadn''t put the title "retro" I wouldn''t have looked for anything.', '2007-01-03 11:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175242, 444990, 43869, '<td valign="top">hmmmm, 2 guesses to who did this:o)   As usual beautiful work.  I can never get enough of these Northern Lights pictures.  They''re so mesmerizing!</td>', 'hmmmm, 2 guesses to who did this:o)   As usual beautiful work.  I can never get enough of these Northern Lights pictures.  They''re so mesmerizing!', '2007-01-03 11:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3175247, 445321, 43869, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  I think I would have cloned out the trees though or moved up so the trees weren''t in it.  Very nice work though.</td>', 'I really like this.  I think I would have cloned out the trees though or moved up so the trees weren''t in it.  Very nice work though.', '2007-01-03 11:30:57.000000', NULL, 1);
