(3176472, 442904, 13958, '<td valign="top">To walk along this beach on a beautifull day like that, must be magic. However on photos, the "booring" sky gives you nothing and the sun in the rock causes distraction. Go back there when it''s claudy or even stormy. You will see the difference.   5</td>', 'To walk along this beach on a beautifull day like that, must be magic. However on photos, the "booring" sky gives you nothing and the sun in the rock causes distraction. Go back there when it''s claudy or even stormy. You will see the difference.   5', '2007-01-03 15:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
