(3177409, 444516, 18191, '<td valign="top">I wish you were able to get closer, for instance where those three water droplets are for a more abstract conposition. I realize that your camera may have been limited in this feature, but it is what I would have wanted to see.</td>', 'I wish you were able to get closer, for instance where those three water droplets are for a more abstract conposition. I realize that your camera may have been limited in this feature, but it is what I would have wanted to see.', '2007-01-03 18:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3177411, 445353, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great tones Comp and funny too....10</td>', 'Great tones Comp and funny too....10', '2007-01-03 18:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3177426, 441103, 18191, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot with an effective compositoin and wodnerful movement. however, I feel that it is very oversaturated in places and there is severe haloing (or possible chromatic abhorration) on the inner part of the girl''s arm and around her thumb. Also, I feel that the grass on the right side of the image is blurred a little to excessively. I think that a reworking of the original image could have spectacular results that would improve upon your already strong edit.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot with an effective compositoin and wodnerful movement. however, I feel that it is very oversaturated in places and there is severe haloing (or possible chromatic abhorration) on the inner part of the girl''s arm and around her thumb. Also, I feel that the grass on the right side of the image is blurred a little to excessively. I think that a reworking of the original image could have spectacular results that would improve upon your already strong edit.', '2007-01-03 18:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3177447, 444495, 18191, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic image. I have only two complaints. First, and what struck me most, was that the blacks on the cord on he rback as well as on the glasses seems unnaturally black. I would have liked to see some detail in the cord, or a large rectangular catchlight in her glasses because with the stark black background they look awkward. The other complaint is the green in the shadows along her right side (camera left) and also under the left part of her chin on her neck and her right shoulder. The coloring of the shadows can easily be altered to better match her skin tone and I feel that these imperfections take away from what is an otherwide flawless image. Great job, though. 8</td>', 'This is a fantastic image. I have only two complaints. First, and what struck me most, was that the blacks on the cord on he rback as well as on the glasses seems unnaturally black. I would have liked to see some detail in the cord, or a large rectangular catchlight in her glasses because with the stark black background they look awkward. The other complaint is the green in the shadows along her right side (camera left) and also under the left part of her chin on her neck and her right shoulder. The coloring of the shadows can easily be altered to better match her skin tone and I feel that these imperfections take away from what is an otherwide flawless image. Great job, though. 8', '2007-01-03 18:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3177499, 436119, 33352, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I am a fan of this type of photo, but a similar photo won the Ballentines world titles for photography..</td>', 'Not sure if I am a fan of this type of photo, but a similar photo won the Ballentines world titles for photography..', '2007-01-03 18:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
