(3178808, 441560, 19982, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of River Walk in San Antonio, TX, but I have no idea if there is a Casa Rio or not (I only visited it once as I was traveling to SA for business, but it was a lovely place).  Anyway, love the imagery here, especially with the all the Christmasy colors.</td>', 'Reminds me of River Walk in San Antonio, TX, but I have no idea if there is a Casa Rio or not (I only visited it once as I was traveling to SA for business, but it was a lovely place).  Anyway, love the imagery here, especially with the all the Christmasy colors.', '2007-01-04 00:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178815, 442116, 19982, '<td valign="top">There''s an outline around the edges of the rocks...   just something to "clean up" before you go to print.</td>', 'There''s an outline around the edges of the rocks...   just something to "clean up" before you go to print.', '2007-01-04 00:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178819, 441093, 30861, '<td valign="top">In many ways this is lovely, if understated, but IMO there''s way too much empty foreground; it''s completely denaturing the image. It''s a very nice B/W conversion :-)</td>', 'In many ways this is lovely, if understated, but IMO there''s way too much empty foreground; it''s completely denaturing the image. It''s a very nice B/W conversion :-)', '2007-01-04 00:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178829, 442528, 30861, '<td valign="top">Got a lot of pop for sure, but the PP is way too harsh IMO. The haloing around the distant buildings and the road overhead just really shrieks at me :-(</td>', 'Got a lot of pop for sure, but the PP is way too harsh IMO. The haloing around the distant buildings and the road overhead just really shrieks at me :-(', '2007-01-04 00:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178834, 444449, 19982, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... another temple shot.  That''s THREE in this challenge!  :-)   I''ll be interested to find out who submitted this one when the challenge is over.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Hmmm... another temple shot.  That''s THREE in this challenge!  :-)   I''ll be interested to find out who submitted this one when the challenge is over.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2007-01-04 00:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178837, 445141, 30861, '<td valign="top">Sheesh, a 7-legged horse! It''s bizarre to look at... In other words, the near-perfect overlap of the two horses is producing some disconcerting effects.</td>', 'Sheesh, a 7-legged horse! It''s bizarre to look at... In other words, the near-perfect overlap of the two horses is producing some disconcerting effects.', '2007-01-04 00:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178846, 438766, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very, very sweet. The perfect balance of ambient and artificial light.</td>', 'Very, very sweet. The perfect balance of ambient and artificial light.', '2007-01-04 00:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178850, 445383, 54540, '<td valign="top">The reflection off of the rock in the foreground sells this shot.  EXCELLENT CAPTURE!</td>', 'The reflection off of the rock in the foreground sells this shot.  EXCELLENT CAPTURE!', '2007-01-04 00:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178858, 444973, 30861, '<td valign="top">This just cries out for a leveled horizon :-( and the unnaturally flat quality of the attempted toning-down of the sun''s hot spot is very offputting to me. It''s an issue I''ve had to fight with often. Otherwise the processing is very nice, soft &amp; glowing and warm.</td>', 'This just cries out for a leveled horizon :-( and the unnaturally flat quality of the attempted toning-down of the sun''s hot spot is very offputting to me. It''s an issue I''ve had to fight with often. Otherwise the processing is very nice, soft & glowing and warm.', '2007-01-04 00:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178867, 437503, 30861, '<td valign="top">Riverwalk in San Antonio? Beautifully captured &amp; rendered.</td>', 'Riverwalk in San Antonio? Beautifully captured & rendered.', '2007-01-04 00:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178869, 445290, 54540, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus on the subject and a pleasing bokeh.  Well done.  (And thank you for the warm greetings!  To you too!)</td>', 'Excellent focus on the subject and a pleasing bokeh.  Well done.  (And thank you for the warm greetings!  To you too!)', '2007-01-04 00:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178875, 435826, 62727, '<td valign="top">WOW!  This is spectacular!!! 10! Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'WOW!  This is spectacular!!! 10! Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-04 00:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178893, 444059, 30861, '<td valign="top">sweet :-)</td>', 'sweet :-)', '2007-01-04 00:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178898, 442921, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is lovely work. Hope it''s not overshadowed in the challenge by images with more superficial pop.</td>', 'This is lovely work. Hope it''s not overshadowed in the challenge by images with more superficial pop.', '2007-01-04 00:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178902, 442875, 62727, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous cat!</td>', 'Gorgeous cat!', '2007-01-04 00:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178906, 439028, 62727, '<td valign="top">Awwww!  He''s so adorable!  Great capture!</td>', 'Awwww!  He''s so adorable!  Great capture!', '2007-01-04 00:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178909, 443367, 54540, '<td valign="top">Good night shot!  Marking as a favorite to find out if this might be St. Johns or not.</td>', 'Good night shot!  Marking as a favorite to find out if this might be St. Johns or not.', '2007-01-04 00:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178917, 445217, 62727, '<td valign="top">Wonderful macro shot!</td>', 'Wonderful macro shot!', '2007-01-04 00:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178955, 438615, 62727, '<td valign="top">Priceless!!</td>', 'Priceless!!', '2007-01-04 00:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178973, 442692, 30861, '<td valign="top">now THAT''s striking :-)</td>', 'now THAT''s striking :-)', '2007-01-04 00:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178979, 444343, 62727, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  This has to be in Australia.</td>', 'Very nice!  This has to be in Australia.', '2007-01-04 00:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3178985, 442692, 62727, '<td valign="top">Stunning image!</td>', 'Stunning image!', '2007-01-04 00:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179206, 441823, 67258, '<td valign="top">Subject wise, this is just a bit too weird for me - a cultural thing, I suspect.  That said, I can''t fault the photograph:  good composition, correct exposure throughout, spot on choice for dof.</td>', 'Subject wise, this is just a bit too weird for me - a cultural thing, I suspect.  That said, I can''t fault the photograph:  good composition, correct exposure throughout, spot on choice for dof.', '2007-01-04 02:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179288, 443683, 57378, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and sharp - I am sure you will get comments about the catch light in his eyes which are a little distracting. Great exposure.</td>', 'Beautiful and sharp - I am sure you will get comments about the catch light in his eyes which are a little distracting. Great exposure.', '2007-01-04 02:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179296, 440750, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great exposure - 9</td>', 'Great exposure - 9', '2007-01-04 02:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179327, 444765, 66515, '<td valign="top">too small (the picture that is)</td>', 'too small (the picture that is)', '2007-01-04 02:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179500, 444249, 56400, '<td valign="top">The angle does not enhance the photo.</td>', 'The angle does not enhance the photo.', '2007-01-04 05:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179506, 444354, 56400, '<td valign="top">You really needed to bring out the blacks more. This is very washed out.</td>', 'You really needed to bring out the blacks more. This is very washed out.', '2007-01-04 05:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179507, 443279, 56400, '<td valign="top">I like it but the focus seems off just a bit on the right side.</td>', 'I like it but the focus seems off just a bit on the right side.', '2007-01-04 05:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179510, 444768, 56400, '<td valign="top">Nice close up with good detail.</td>', 'Nice close up with good detail.', '2007-01-04 05:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179514, 444719, 56400, '<td valign="top">The grain works here. It gives the shot a vintage look.</td>', 'The grain works here. It gives the shot a vintage look.', '2007-01-04 05:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179549, 441526, 6999, '<td valign="top">Composition seems forced - why have the fountain so close to the column, and yet have so much remaining space either side? If you''d separated them so that they were placed more independently in frame you''d surely have a more satisfying image, no? I''m not aware of anything that would be more distracting than your current background if you did that ... Nicely done exposure wise though, but that isn''t enough to overcome the compositional problem.</td>', 'Composition seems forced - why have the fountain so close to the column, and yet have so much remaining space either side? If you''d separated them so that they were placed more independently in frame you''d surely have a more satisfying image, no? I''m not aware of anything that would be more distracting than your current background if you did that ... Nicely done exposure wise though, but that isn''t enough to overcome the compositional problem.', '2007-01-04 06:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179552, 444639, 6999, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a shame you couldn''t have framed the big boat and the little more happily - as it stands, the container ship looks like an accidental inclusion. Quite effective light, though perhaps use of colour only serves to make the scene look washed out, where black and white would emphasise the shapes more.</td>', 'Perhaps a shame you couldn''t have framed the big boat and the little more happily - as it stands, the container ship looks like an accidental inclusion. Quite effective light, though perhaps use of colour only serves to make the scene look washed out, where black and white would emphasise the shapes more.', '2007-01-04 06:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179554, 445327, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent framing, and I like the implicit softness of it. Effective for what it is.</td>', 'Excellent framing, and I like the implicit softness of it. Effective for what it is.', '2007-01-04 06:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179556, 445237, 6999, '<td valign="top">The red key-line is discomforting - seems only to emphasise the more pale colours in your composition. I think a touch more contrast would help - it seems to have a narrow dynamic range.</td>', 'The red key-line is discomforting - seems only to emphasise the more pale colours in your composition. I think a touch more contrast would help - it seems to have a narrow dynamic range.', '2007-01-04 06:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179574, 437871, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good detail and colour, and I quite like the composition; I wonder if you mightn''t have got even closer, and completely filled the frame with the bird - it seems a little half and half.</td>', 'Good detail and colour, and I quite like the composition; I wonder if you mightn''t have got even closer, and completely filled the frame with the bird - it seems a little half and half.', '2007-01-04 07:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179576, 444049, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strange artefacts, either from smoothing or processing generally - make the image seem odd to my eye. Not the happiest composition - too many bits of other animals emerging from behind the ones we can see.</td>', 'Strange artefacts, either from smoothing or processing generally - make the image seem odd to my eye. Not the happiest composition - too many bits of other animals emerging from behind the ones we can see.', '2007-01-04 07:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179579, 445357, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good exposure. Could perhaps use a touch more thought around the composition - almost parallel, almost diagonal, and the single tree at bottom of image seems ignored.</td>', 'Good exposure. Could perhaps use a touch more thought around the composition - almost parallel, almost diagonal, and the single tree at bottom of image seems ignored.', '2007-01-04 07:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179580, 444623, 6999, '<td valign="top">It''ll be a struggle for the little dear, now, won''t it? Nice moment, though there''s a strong sense of lack of resolution to this image - the fine detail just isn''t there.</td>', 'It''ll be a struggle for the little dear, now, won''t it? Nice moment, though there''s a strong sense of lack of resolution to this image - the fine detail just isn''t there.', '2007-01-04 07:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179583, 443491, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think you could happily use a little more contrast; whilst there''s good range throughout the image, the facial details all seem to fall into the same fairly narrow band of grey. I think that makes the image look slightly washed-out, in the end; and it doesn''t sem to me to be that important to see much in the magazine, and the background is already pretty bright, so what is there to lose?</td>', 'I think you could happily use a little more contrast; whilst there''s good range throughout the image, the facial details all seem to fall into the same fairly narrow band of grey. I think that makes the image look slightly washed-out, in the end; and it doesn''t sem to me to be that important to see much in the magazine, and the background is already pretty bright, so what is there to lose?', '2007-01-04 07:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179586, 440864, 6999, '<td valign="top">The foreground-left tree - really upsets this image to my eye. Whether a different framing was possible or not, those branches really intrude into your primary subject here. I get a strong feeling that I''d have tried simply to move about five yards to the right, and used all that hay as a foreground ...</td>', 'The foreground-left tree - really upsets this image to my eye. Whether a different framing was possible or not, those branches really intrude into your primary subject here. I get a strong feeling that I''d have tried simply to move about five yards to the right, and used all that hay as a foreground ...', '2007-01-04 07:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179632, 439500, 31341, '<td valign="top">nice textures and colors.</td>', 'nice textures and colors.', '2007-01-04 07:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179642, 444948, 31341, '<td valign="top">This is nice technically, color, light, focus, etc.  However, I think the aspect of the still life needs to be better composed.  You have parts of a bunch of things, but nothing that puts what this all is in context.</td>', 'This is nice technically, color, light, focus, etc.  However, I think the aspect of the still life needs to be better composed.  You have parts of a bunch of things, but nothing that puts what this all is in context.', '2007-01-04 07:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179650, 444838, 31341, '<td valign="top">I like this...nice colors and composition, but bring up the levels to brighten it some, and it would pop.</td>', 'I like this...nice colors and composition, but bring up the levels to brighten it some, and it would pop.', '2007-01-04 07:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179680, 445396, 70554, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome scene but underexposed. Your snow is gray, not white.</td>', 'This is an awesome scene but underexposed. Your snow is gray, not white.', '2007-01-04 08:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179688, 444126, 70554, '<td valign="top">Looks like the sticks above are sharper than your bird. This would be better if you used the center focus point on your camera and locked on the bird''s eye.</td>', 'Looks like the sticks above are sharper than your bird. This would be better if you used the center focus point on your camera and locked on the bird''s eye.', '2007-01-04 08:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179707, 444138, 43565, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title.</td>', 'I don''t get the title.', '2007-01-04 08:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179723, 439143, 70554, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait! I don''t think you need the haze/glow effect. It would be lovely without it.</td>', 'Nice portrait! I don''t think you need the haze/glow effect. It would be lovely without it.', '2007-01-04 08:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179732, 444217, 70554, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2007-01-04 08:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179745, 445335, 68586, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Nice balance of light and colours.</td>', 'Great composition. Nice balance of light and colours.', '2007-01-04 08:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179747, 443640, 68586, '<td valign="top">nice picture - all the better for being in Black &amp; White !</td>', 'nice picture - all the better for being in Black & White !', '2007-01-04 08:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179755, 441464, 68586, '<td valign="top">Perhaps it could have been cropped a little tighter on the left for my taste, but nice picture, nice balance of light and saturation.</td>', 'Perhaps it could have been cropped a little tighter on the left for my taste, but nice picture, nice balance of light and saturation.', '2007-01-04 08:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3179758, 443518, 68586, '<td valign="top">nice feel of depth to this, and good range of colours.</td>', 'nice feel of depth to this, and good range of colours.', '2007-01-04 08:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180007, 443073, 21816, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colour and good crop. A great capture. Good luck!</td>', 'Wonderful colour and good crop. A great capture. Good luck!', '2007-01-04 10:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180018, 443941, 21816, '<td valign="top">A really dreamy effect you''ve captured here. Nice work.</td>', 'A really dreamy effect you''ve captured here. Nice work.', '2007-01-04 10:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180022, 439974, 21816, '<td valign="top">Great detail and well framed.</td>', 'Great detail and well framed.', '2007-01-04 10:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180034, 445369, 21816, '<td valign="top">I love the photo but I just feel it looks kind of flat. Maybe a little more curves adjustment would make her really shine. Other than that it''s fantastic. Good luck!</td>', 'I love the photo but I just feel it looks kind of flat. Maybe a little more curves adjustment would make her really shine. Other than that it''s fantastic. Good luck!', '2007-01-04 10:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180041, 441110, 21816, '<td valign="top">Wow. Awesome shot. I love the tones and the framing is spot on. Well done!</td>', 'Wow. Awesome shot. I love the tones and the framing is spot on. Well done!', '2007-01-04 10:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180069, 444198, 61222, '<td valign="top">Great detail, color and clarity</td>', 'Great detail, color and clarity', '2007-01-04 10:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180163, 443279, 34134, '<td valign="top">Nice, but horizon needs to be leveled.</td>', 'Nice, but horizon needs to be leveled.', '2007-01-04 10:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180171, 434506, 34134, '<td valign="top">Cool. Or should I say Cold. Nice capture.</td>', 'Cool. Or should I say Cold. Nice capture.', '2007-01-04 10:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180185, 439500, 34134, '<td valign="top">I like the processing.</td>', 'I like the processing.', '2007-01-04 10:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180189, 445298, 66497, '<td valign="top">i love the colors</td>', 'i love the colors', '2007-01-04 10:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180193, 437789, 66497, '<td valign="top">just beautiful... -8</td>', 'just beautiful... -8', '2007-01-04 10:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180195, 445254, 66497, '<td valign="top">good title... gives me chills</td>', 'good title... gives me chills', '2007-01-04 10:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180197, 440189, 66497, '<td valign="top">almost psychedelic (spelling?).... nice pic</td>', 'almost psychedelic (spelling?).... nice pic', '2007-01-04 10:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180198, 445027, 66497, '<td valign="top">such wonder for the other side of the hill</td>', 'such wonder for the other side of the hill', '2007-01-04 10:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180205, 442024, 66497, '<td valign="top">what a fun picture</td>', 'what a fun picture', '2007-01-04 10:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180229, 444756, 34134, '<td valign="top">I think I would have leveled the background and let the subject be leaning slightly forward. If it was just the trash can, it''d work, but the buildings don''t look normal.<br/> <br/>Contast is OK, but focus is a bit soft. The shoes are too overexposed.</td>', 'I think I would have leveled the background and let the subject be leaning slightly forward. If it was just the trash can, it''d work, but the buildings don''t look normal. Contast is OK, but focus is a bit soft. The shoes are too overexposed.', '2007-01-04 10:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180302, 434848, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good composition; I like the waythe triangles play off the lines in the sky.</td>', 'Good composition; I like the waythe triangles play off the lines in the sky.', '2007-01-04 11:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180304, 445385, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good job capturing the expression.</td>', 'Good job capturing the expression.', '2007-01-04 11:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180319, 436496, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the sky; blown out lights are distracting.</td>', 'Nice job on the sky; blown out lights are distracting.', '2007-01-04 11:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180336, 437795, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice capture; waves look great.  The surfer and board look a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'Nice capture; waves look great.  The surfer and board look a bit oversharpened.', '2007-01-04 11:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180359, 444979, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good idea and I like the framing by the window.  However, it''s hard to see the eyes.</td>', 'Good idea and I like the framing by the window.  However, it''s hard to see the eyes.', '2007-01-04 11:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180388, 444973, 34134, '<td valign="top">If only the horizon was level!!! Great shot and processing.</td>', 'If only the horizon was level!!! Great shot and processing.', '2007-01-04 11:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180418, 443935, 41794, '<td valign="top">Lovely, simple, elegant!</td>', 'Lovely, simple, elegant!', '2007-01-04 11:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180419, 445382, 41794, '<td valign="top">Love the warm, rich colors.</td>', 'Love the warm, rich colors.', '2007-01-04 11:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180422, 444990, 41794, '<td valign="top">Absolutely amazing! Lovely color and great reflection!</td>', 'Absolutely amazing! Lovely color and great reflection!', '2007-01-04 11:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180423, 445065, 41794, '<td valign="top">One of the cutest kitten shots ever! Great detail and light. And I just love the intent look on its face!</td>', 'One of the cutest kitten shots ever! Great detail and light. And I just love the intent look on its face!', '2007-01-04 11:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180426, 442100, 41794, '<td valign="top">Awesome action shot! The color and perspective are great. Love how you even caught the sand (?) coming up behind the ATV.</td>', 'Awesome action shot! The color and perspective are great. Love how you even caught the sand (?) coming up behind the ATV.', '2007-01-04 11:41:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3180430, 444775, 41794, '<td valign="top">This has to ribbon...I am so drawn to this portrait. His face may look hardened, but there is still light in his eyes and I think that tells his story more than anything. You did a wonderful job capturing that spirit. 10!!</td>', 'This has to ribbon...I am so drawn to this portrait. His face may look hardened, but there is still light in his eyes and I think that tells his story more than anything. You did a wonderful job capturing that spirit. 10!!', '2007-01-04 11:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180432, 441231, 41794, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and bokeh.</td>', 'Great lighting and bokeh.', '2007-01-04 11:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180433, 443640, 41794, '<td valign="top">I can see why...this is a beautiful shot. Love the range of black and white tones throughout the photo. I like the use of the fence in the foreground to add some perspective as well.</td>', 'I can see why...this is a beautiful shot. Love the range of black and white tones throughout the photo. I like the use of the fence in the foreground to add some perspective as well.', '2007-01-04 11:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180435, 443367, 31443, '<td valign="top">This is such a beautiful place, must be by a lake...brilliant capture.</td>', 'This is such a beautiful place, must be by a lake...brilliant capture.', '2007-01-04 11:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180436, 442692, 41794, '<td valign="top">LOVE the moodiness of this shot...the dark woods with the light on the back of the angel. Fantastic!</td>', 'LOVE the moodiness of this shot...the dark woods with the light on the back of the angel. Fantastic!', '2007-01-04 11:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180439, 443538, 42495, '<td valign="top">Might be interesting to see a sharp macro of the ice.</td>', 'Might be interesting to see a sharp macro of the ice.', '2007-01-04 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180440, 443944, 41794, '<td valign="top">Excellent post processing...dark sky with the brightness of the building, especially the domes.</td>', 'Excellent post processing...dark sky with the brightness of the building, especially the domes.', '2007-01-04 11:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180445, 444126, 41794, '<td valign="top">Wonderful bird pic...I know how small chickadees are and you did a great job of not losing any detail. The branch it is on is a perfect "frame" for the little one as well.</td>', 'Wonderful bird pic...I know how small chickadees are and you did a great job of not losing any detail. The branch it is on is a perfect "frame" for the little one as well.', '2007-01-04 11:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180446, 440864, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition.  Good job on the pp.  Only nitpick is the tires on by fence that could have been cloned out.</td>', 'Nice colors and composition.  Good job on the pp.  Only nitpick is the tires on by fence that could have been cloned out.', '2007-01-04 11:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180448, 444723, 41794, '<td valign="top">I really like the progression of color through this pic...dark foreground to the scattered light clouds and then the warm sky. Lovely.</td>', 'I really like the progression of color through this pic...dark foreground to the scattered light clouds and then the warm sky. Lovely.', '2007-01-04 11:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180554, 444354, 2612, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but I think you would benefit from a little more contrast. If you are using an editing application that supports curves you can control the contrast across the train engine without your highlight getting blown out. Good work and thanks for sharing.</td>', 'I like the shot, but I think you would benefit from a little more contrast. If you are using an editing application that supports curves you can control the contrast across the train engine without your highlight getting blown out. Good work and thanks for sharing.', '2007-01-04 12:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180596, 444128, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think there are a couple of immediate problems with this shot: but first off, I should say that detail, processing and tonality are pretty good. I have an issue with the very direct-seeming flash lighting - it flattens the whole image of the man, leaving very little sense of texture or of form in three dimensions. Secondly, the composition lacks some grace I think: what appears important to me is his expression and his hands - both of which are contained in one small area of the image to the mid-left - and the rest serves little to emphasise anything not contained there. The historical dress is plain from the sleeves of his shirt, and what you have included of background makes little addition to the image.</td>', 'I think there are a couple of immediate problems with this shot: but first off, I should say that detail, processing and tonality are pretty good. I have an issue with the very direct-seeming flash lighting - it flattens the whole image of the man, leaving very little sense of texture or of form in three dimensions. Secondly, the composition lacks some grace I think: what appears important to me is his expression and his hands - both of which are contained in one small area of the image to the mid-left - and the rest serves little to emphasise anything not contained there. The historical dress is plain from the sleeves of his shirt, and what you have included of background makes little addition to the image.', '2007-01-04 12:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180602, 442622, 6999, '<td valign="top">Feels over-exposed to me - though I can understand the wish to achieve a pale winter feeling, I think you''ve taken things a touch far - especially the line of her nose and her left cheek. The top of jacket interrupting the line of her jaw is a shame too - for a best photo of the month.</td>', 'Feels over-exposed to me - though I can understand the wish to achieve a pale winter feeling, I think you''ve taken things a touch far - especially the line of her nose and her left cheek. The top of jacket interrupting the line of her jaw is a shame too - for a best photo of the month.', '2007-01-04 12:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180611, 444326, 6999, '<td valign="top">It''s perhaps a shame to have placed the figure so that the island is immediately behind him, confusing the two main distant elements of your image. To emphasise the footprints and the progression through frame I think you should have framed that subject further up the frame anyway - the dynamic doesn''t quite lead us far enough, really.</td>', 'It''s perhaps a shame to have placed the figure so that the island is immediately behind him, confusing the two main distant elements of your image. To emphasise the footprints and the progression through frame I think you should have framed that subject further up the frame anyway - the dynamic doesn''t quite lead us far enough, really.', '2007-01-04 12:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180619, 444354, 6999, '<td valign="top">Now this has a horribly washed-out appearance. I''m sure others will have mentioned too.</td>', 'Now this has a horribly washed-out appearance. I''m sure others will have mentioned too.', '2007-01-04 12:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180630, 441690, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, for me though it has a weird processed feel to it - there appear to be splodges of light all over the boarding, almost arbitrarily, and having nothing to do with the feel of light in the rest of the scene, with the result that the image feels more like an illustration than a photograph.</td>', 'Nice composition, for me though it has a weird processed feel to it - there appear to be splodges of light all over the boarding, almost arbitrarily, and having nothing to do with the feel of light in the rest of the scene, with the result that the image feels more like an illustration than a photograph.', '2007-01-04 12:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180641, 443635, 6999, '<td valign="top">Neatly done, technically. It rather gives the impression that snails might be made of stone - though that I suspect is accidental. I fear that the simple technical achievement isn''t in itself interesting enough, certainly for me.</td>', 'Neatly done, technically. It rather gives the impression that snails might be made of stone - though that I suspect is accidental. I fear that the simple technical achievement isn''t in itself interesting enough, certainly for me.', '2007-01-04 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180673, 441823, 6999, '<td valign="top">Guaranteed to cause a wide variety of responses: mine is unfavourable.</td>', 'Guaranteed to cause a wide variety of responses: mine is unfavourable.', '2007-01-04 12:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180776, 442622, 68586, '<td valign="top">The skin is a little burnt out and lacking in texture for me, and I would have preferred it if the coller had not obscured the chin. That said it is a niceshot and I like the framing of the face with the fur.</td>', 'The skin is a little burnt out and lacking in texture for me, and I would have preferred it if the coller had not obscured the chin. That said it is a niceshot and I like the framing of the face with the fur.', '2007-01-04 13:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180784, 445299, 68586, '<td valign="top">Hmm haven''t we seen a variant of this in the fences challenge ;) I still like it though so you can have another vote.</td>', 'Hmm haven''t we seen a variant of this in the fences challenge ;) I still like it though so you can have another vote.', '2007-01-04 13:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180785, 445166, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like your composition very much, but there are a couple of things bugging me. One is an out-of-place sense of blurriness about the tank-thing - it may simply be the way it looks, or it may be a processing artefact, but it doesn''t seem to belong to the same graphical world as the rest of the composition - especially given such a strong sense of fine detail in the stain itself. Secondly a sense of lens distortion that adds a feeling of precipitousness to the image; I might, myself, have tried a touch of correction on that. But I like the shapes very much. Doesn''t quite give me enough - it lacks a real sense of photographic fun, I suppose - to really entrance, but it''s many times more interesting/arresting than all these pets, kids and landscapes.</td>', 'I like your composition very much, but there are a couple of things bugging me. One is an out-of-place sense of blurriness about the tank-thing - it may simply be the way it looks, or it may be a processing artefact, but it doesn''t seem to belong to the same graphical world as the rest of the composition - especially given such a strong sense of fine detail in the stain itself. Secondly a sense of lens distortion that adds a feeling of precipitousness to the image; I might, myself, have tried a touch of correction on that. But I like the shapes very much. Doesn''t quite give me enough - it lacks a real sense of photographic fun, I suppose - to really entrance, but it''s many times more interesting/arresting than all these pets, kids and landscapes.', '2007-01-04 13:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180802, 445398, 21714, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the scary posters you see of the eye when you are waiting to see a doc. I think it would have been better cropped tight and without the hot spots. The colours and details are nice and the image would be far more interesting if as an abstract, I think.</td>', 'This reminds me of the scary posters you see of the eye when you are waiting to see a doc. I think it would have been better cropped tight and without the hot spots. The colours and details are nice and the image would be far more interesting if as an abstract, I think.', '2007-01-04 13:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180812, 439487, 6999, '<td valign="top">Your use of the clone-tool is beyond the pale ... er, no, hang on. I would wish for a little more from this - though what, I don''t quite know - it''s a nice moment captured, and intriguing - especially the near-absolute repetition of forms, but somehow it''s not properly emphasised in your image. I don''t know: black and white, perhaps? Allow us to get away from the muted winter colours and the horses'' own colour and concentrate on the forms more? Perhaps some more contrast work would achieve the same effect? Or simply a darkening overall, but really, anything to devote more of the attention to those parallel forms, and less to the overall environment - perhaps those greens in the background also draw the eye, and deflect from the real point of this?</td>', 'Your use of the clone-tool is beyond the pale ... er, no, hang on. I would wish for a little more from this - though what, I don''t quite know - it''s a nice moment captured, and intriguing - especially the near-absolute repetition of forms, but somehow it''s not properly emphasised in your image. I don''t know: black and white, perhaps? Allow us to get away from the muted winter colours and the horses'' own colour and concentrate on the forms more? Perhaps some more contrast work would achieve the same effect? Or simply a darkening overall, but really, anything to devote more of the attention to those parallel forms, and less to the overall environment - perhaps those greens in the background also draw the eye, and deflect from the real point of this?', '2007-01-04 13:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180825, 443429, 21714, '<td valign="top">What do you say to this? F****** brilliant! (I don''t talk the art talk you see)</td>', 'What do you say to this? F****** brilliant! (I don''t talk the art talk you see)', '2007-01-04 13:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180826, 439126, 6999, '<td valign="top">Well enough done, but more consideration for background elements might pay off - the overlap of your main subject with those behind makes for some discomfort of viewing.</td>', 'Well enough done, but more consideration for background elements might pay off - the overlap of your main subject with those behind makes for some discomfort of viewing.', '2007-01-04 13:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180845, 445233, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lacks more than a little punch - especially for this place. Have a look at the histogram and I''m sure you''ll find there was more dynamic range available. The detail is good, and most of the obvious technicals, but one thing that nearly always fails such photographs is attention to background ...</td>', 'Lacks more than a little punch - especially for this place. Have a look at the histogram and I''m sure you''ll find there was more dynamic range available. The detail is good, and most of the obvious technicals, but one thing that nearly always fails such photographs is attention to background ...', '2007-01-04 13:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180853, 445222, 21714, '<td valign="top">Great job destroying this shot (initial reaction). Now wondering what you have done to it. Not liking the result.</td>', 'Great job destroying this shot (initial reaction). Now wondering what you have done to it. Not liking the result.', '2007-01-04 13:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180854, 434934, 6999, '<td valign="top">A very confused composition. The tonality suggests simplicity, and the organisation of forms the opposite, which makes for a difficult sense of what this is about.</td>', 'A very confused composition. The tonality suggests simplicity, and the organisation of forms the opposite, which makes for a difficult sense of what this is about.', '2007-01-04 13:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180864, 443278, 21714, '<td valign="top">Fav + 10. I wish I could do this.</td>', 'Fav + 10. I wish I could do this.', '2007-01-04 13:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180866, 445161, 6999, '<td valign="top">Difficult to get away from the trick aspect of infra-red, without which I suspect this isn''t up to much. And if it were, why impose the funny look on it? I suppose I just don''t get the IR thing, but then I''m still part of your audience ...</td>', 'Difficult to get away from the trick aspect of infra-red, without which I suspect this isn''t up to much. And if it were, why impose the funny look on it? I suppose I just don''t get the IR thing, but then I''m still part of your audience ...', '2007-01-04 13:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180876, 437789, 6999, '<td valign="top">Gosh, looks odd - some kind of over-smoothing thing going on? Funny selections and all that? Don''t like that feel much.</td>', 'Gosh, looks odd - some kind of over-smoothing thing going on? Funny selections and all that? Don''t like that feel much.', '2007-01-04 13:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180896, 440864, 7969, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but think it would of been stronger if you had cropped the top inch or so off</td>', 'I like this shot but think it would of been stronger if you had cropped the top inch or so off', '2007-01-04 13:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180898, 434506, 66709, '<td valign="top">you know what they no pain no gain!</td>', 'you know what they no pain no gain!', '2007-01-04 13:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180899, 444565, 6999, '<td valign="top">Given the smallness of those birds in frame anyway, I think you''d have been well advised to use the full available size limit - and from a purely graphic design point of view I think the brown outer border is a mistake. It might have had a nice even winter groove to it, but it''s hard to get past those elements really. Strong use of leading lines to make the centred composition comfortable though.</td>', 'Given the smallness of those birds in frame anyway, I think you''d have been well advised to use the full available size limit - and from a purely graphic design point of view I think the brown outer border is a mistake. It might have had a nice even winter groove to it, but it''s hard to get past those elements really. Strong use of leading lines to make the centred composition comfortable though.', '2007-01-04 13:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180906, 444654, 7969, '<td valign="top">great capture 10  I would clone out the fence at some point and then it would be really phenomenal -</td>', 'great capture 10  I would clone out the fence at some point and then it would be really phenomenal -', '2007-01-04 13:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180910, 442692, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent moment of light, and well captured. Some, I''m sure, just don''t like pics of statues, as though getting someone to stand still whilst dressed up makes them any more important, but I think you''ll get knocked a little for that.</td>', 'Excellent moment of light, and well captured. Some, I''m sure, just don''t like pics of statues, as though getting someone to stand still whilst dressed up makes them any more important, but I think you''ll get knocked a little for that.', '2007-01-04 13:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180911, 443937, 7969, '<td valign="top">very nice shot of a local mountain! 9</td>', 'very nice shot of a local mountain! 9', '2007-01-04 13:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180912, 441800, 21714, '<td valign="top">Absolutely brilliant. That''s how you photograph a kid!</td>', 'Absolutely brilliant. That''s how you photograph a kid!', '2007-01-04 13:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180917, 445348, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the tree and sky, but the equipment is lost in the shadows.</td>', 'I like the tree and sky, but the equipment is lost in the shadows.', '2007-01-04 13:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180944, 440750, 21714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light used well. Wonderful.</td>', 'Beautiful light used well. Wonderful.', '2007-01-04 13:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180991, 435958, 21714, '<td valign="top">This looks really flat, like cardboard work. Gone a bit too far with a filter?</td>', 'This looks really flat, like cardboard work. Gone a bit too far with a filter?', '2007-01-04 13:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3180999, 443454, 21714, '<td valign="top">it''s hard to see anything and I am not wanting to see much.</td>', 'it''s hard to see anything and I am not wanting to see much.', '2007-01-04 13:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181028, 444967, 8139, '<td valign="top">I visited some years ago. Still so impressive. Good angle of view.</td>', 'I visited some years ago. Still so impressive. Good angle of view.', '2007-01-04 13:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181045, 445058, 8139, '<td valign="top">Moody.</td>', 'Moody.', '2007-01-04 14:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181069, 443695, 2612, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but the bright white of the glove really pulls attention away from the little guy''s face.</td>', 'I like the concept, but the bright white of the glove really pulls attention away from the little guy''s face.', '2007-01-04 14:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181085, 444416, 2612, '<td valign="top">I''ll score this pretty well because I like the concept, but I have one question about the execution. You have very nice rim/side lighting on her chest and left leg yet her face is in silhouette. I think the image would have more impact all in silhouette or all with the very nice side lighting.</td>', 'I''ll score this pretty well because I like the concept, but I have one question about the execution. You have very nice rim/side lighting on her chest and left leg yet her face is in silhouette. I think the image would have more impact all in silhouette or all with the very nice side lighting.', '2007-01-04 14:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181246, 444353, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s an odd sensation of her being slightly disconnected from her environment; like she''s floating, almost. I think the location - the shapes given to this image by the stairs and so on, might have been handled slightly better, making them a stronger contributor to the composition rather than simply a background, which is how they seem here.</td>', 'There''s an odd sensation of her being slightly disconnected from her environment; like she''s floating, almost. I think the location - the shapes given to this image by the stairs and so on, might have been handled slightly better, making them a stronger contributor to the composition rather than simply a background, which is how they seem here.', '2007-01-04 14:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181247, 443444, 67258, '<td valign="top">Whitby - yes?  I am going for a day out here tomorrow (assuming I am correct!).  Bit of bracing North Sea air should blow away the cobwebs.</td>', 'Whitby - yes?  I am going for a day out here tomorrow (assuming I am correct!).  Bit of bracing North Sea air should blow away the cobwebs.', '2007-01-04 14:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181249, 444723, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good groove and colours - the foreground seems to have been knocked a bit by (presumably) the increase of contrast elsewhere.</td>', 'Good groove and colours - the foreground seems to have been knocked a bit by (presumably) the increase of contrast elsewhere.', '2007-01-04 14:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181254, 443062, 67258, '<td valign="top">I don''t much care for the post-processing - far too ''overdone'' for my taste.  I would love to see it with a more subtle treatment, ''though.</td>', 'I don''t much care for the post-processing - far too ''overdone'' for my taste.  I would love to see it with a more subtle treatment, ''though.', '2007-01-04 14:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181256, 443414, 6999, '<td valign="top">I quite like this - it has a degree of photographic integrity that is missing from many images around here - that is, you''ve kept it feeling like a photograph rather than an illustration. I''m not totally sold on this composition - perhaps the sun is too far right in frame, perhaps the car doesn''t intrude enough to feel like a genuine element ... not sure.</td>', 'I quite like this - it has a degree of photographic integrity that is missing from many images around here - that is, you''ve kept it feeling like a photograph rather than an illustration. I''m not totally sold on this composition - perhaps the sun is too far right in frame, perhaps the car doesn''t intrude enough to feel like a genuine element ... not sure.', '2007-01-04 14:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181266, 445295, 6999, '<td valign="top">My first challenge here was ''The Egg'' - some 200 later, I still have the feeling that it makes for a far more difficult subject than most would admit of. Strong sense of texture here, well handled lighting, good composition.</td>', 'My first challenge here was ''The Egg'' - some 200 later, I still have the feeling that it makes for a far more difficult subject than most would admit of. Strong sense of texture here, well handled lighting, good composition.', '2007-01-04 14:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181270, 442482, 6999, '<td valign="top">A bit twee for my taste, but excellently done for what it is. The foreground bokeh is nice too - though that''s a bugbear for many, as I expect some will have commented.</td>', 'A bit twee for my taste, but excellently done for what it is. The foreground bokeh is nice too - though that''s a bugbear for many, as I expect some will have commented.', '2007-01-04 14:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181276, 444314, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like. Not wholly sold on the metal tonality, as i think it might have been interesting enough in simple black and white: likewise I wonder if you might not have made more of the shapes and patterns within the water. A fine contemplative study nevertheless.</td>', 'I like. Not wholly sold on the metal tonality, as i think it might have been interesting enough in simple black and white: likewise I wonder if you might not have made more of the shapes and patterns within the water. A fine contemplative study nevertheless.', '2007-01-04 15:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181285, 439124, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice mood, though personally I find it lacking in anything more than just mood - not quite enough to stand out for me these days; there are so many good mood photographs.</td>', 'Nice mood, though personally I find it lacking in anything more than just mood - not quite enough to stand out for me these days; there are so many good mood photographs.', '2007-01-04 15:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181326, 435031, 33947, '<td valign="top">Too dark on my monitor...can''t make it out.</td>', 'Too dark on my monitor...can''t make it out.', '2007-01-04 15:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181334, 444643, 67258, '<td valign="top">Superb focus, lovely bokehed (can bokeh be used as a verb?..) You have certainly revealed the texture in the butterfly''s wings - one of the best butterfly photos I have ever seen.</td>', 'Superb focus, lovely bokehed (can bokeh be used as a verb?..) You have certainly revealed the texture in the butterfly''s wings - one of the best butterfly photos I have ever seen.', '2007-01-04 15:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181337, 444761, 67258, '<td valign="top">Superb work!  How close were you able to get?  What lens were you using?  The European Grey Heron is quite a shy and elusive bird.</td>', 'Superb work!  How close were you able to get?  What lens were you using?  The European Grey Heron is quite a shy and elusive bird.', '2007-01-04 15:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181344, 441104, 67258, '<td valign="top">I am glad that you told us this is a zoo shot - it means that we are able to vote and comment having some idea of the conditions faced.  Composition and exposure are both good - would make a great Christmas Card next year!</td>', 'I am glad that you told us this is a zoo shot - it means that we are able to vote and comment having some idea of the conditions faced.  Composition and exposure are both good - would make a great Christmas Card next year!', '2007-01-04 15:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181353, 435454, 67258, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good detail in the snow - I can fel the cold!  You deserve a high score just for lugging your camera up into such a hostile environment.</td>', 'Nice composition, good detail in the snow - I can fel the cold!  You deserve a high score just for lugging your camera up into such a hostile environment.', '2007-01-04 15:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181367, 441462, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I''d be intrigued to know why you didn''t shoot the area with more of these things. This is just fine as it stands - a suitably odd subverting of a normally pretty landscape - but it''s clear from this image that there were several other options. One stump is interesting - more than one ...</td>', 'Interesting. I''d be intrigued to know why you didn''t shoot the area with more of these things. This is just fine as it stands - a suitably odd subverting of a normally pretty landscape - but it''s clear from this image that there were several other options. One stump is interesting - more than one ...', '2007-01-04 15:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181426, 435426, 60224, '<td valign="top">Cool shot</td>', 'Cool shot', '2007-01-04 15:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181428, 440750, 60224, '<td valign="top">Great color and textures.</td>', 'Great color and textures.', '2007-01-04 15:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181432, 439500, 60224, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. Love the colors and feel.</td>', 'Very cool shot. Love the colors and feel.', '2007-01-04 15:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181439, 445198, 60224, '<td valign="top">Hi.....Tim</td>', 'Hi.....Tim', '2007-01-04 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181454, 444737, 60224, '<td valign="top">Wish it was bit crisper. I like the idea and the location looks awesome.</td>', 'Wish it was bit crisper. I like the idea and the location looks awesome.', '2007-01-04 15:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181470, 445064, 60224, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2007-01-04 15:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
