(3184459, 445298, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space, and I like that you didn''t oversaturate the sky in DPC-style.  Too bad the fence was there, a silhouette of just the bike would have made this even better.</td>', 'Good use of negative space, and I like that you didn''t oversaturate the sky in DPC-style.  Too bad the fence was there, a silhouette of just the bike would have made this even better.', '2007-01-05 10:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184463, 438615, 43774, '<td valign="top">Tim? I think this is yours. I''ve been noticing this a lot in your photos lately, the skin tones are blotchy, red and look as if they have too much neat image. You''ve been scoring pretty well, though, so maybe I am the only one who doesn''t like it.</td>', 'Tim? I think this is yours. I''ve been noticing this a lot in your photos lately, the skin tones are blotchy, red and look as if they have too much neat image. You''ve been scoring pretty well, though, so maybe I am the only one who doesn''t like it.', '2007-01-05 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184464, 438502, 43774, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, beautiful portrait, great reproduction of the painting.</td>', 'Oh wow, beautiful portrait, great reproduction of the painting.', '2007-01-05 10:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184465, 445358, 43774, '<td valign="top">Why, why, why would you cut off the bottom arm??????</td>', 'Why, why, why would you cut off the bottom arm??????', '2007-01-05 10:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184468, 445295, 43774, '<td valign="top">I can see some blotchyness in the top of the photo and a big blob in the middle at the bottom, looks like you cloned something out.</td>', 'I can see some blotchyness in the top of the photo and a big blob in the middle at the bottom, looks like you cloned something out.', '2007-01-05 10:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184469, 445163, 43774, '<td valign="top">Really nice, wish the bottom wasn''t cut off, could clone out a few specks too, that would make this perfect.</td>', 'Really nice, wish the bottom wasn''t cut off, could clone out a few specks too, that would make this perfect.', '2007-01-05 10:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
