(3184726, 438502, 34134, '<td valign="top">WOW!!! Has she aged well. Still beautiful at over 300 years old!! This is truly a wonderful capture. Kudos to you and your model. 10</td>', 'WOW!!! Has she aged well. Still beautiful at over 300 years old!! This is truly a wonderful capture. Kudos to you and your model. 10', '2007-01-05 11:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184727, 445157, 32345, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure... it looks more out of focus than soft focus.</td>', 'I''m not sure... it looks more out of focus than soft focus.', '2007-01-05 11:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184735, 442916, 15204, '<td valign="top">I think the camera tilt and distortion here unbalance this serene scene.  I would rotate counterclockwise so that the doorframe and corner are perfectly vertical.  The angle and perspective make her feet look too large and her head too small.  Other than that, I think this is nicely composed and the lighting is soft and pleasant.</td>', 'I think the camera tilt and distortion here unbalance this serene scene.  I would rotate counterclockwise so that the doorframe and corner are perfectly vertical.  The angle and perspective make her feet look too large and her head too small.  Other than that, I think this is nicely composed and the lighting is soft and pleasant.', '2007-01-05 11:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184740, 444593, 32345, '<td valign="top">It seems to be a nice sunset but your point of vue is not very good. It looks more like a snap shot than anything else. The power lines and the houses are killing it.</td>', 'It seems to be a nice sunset but your point of vue is not very good. It looks more like a snap shot than anything else. The power lines and the houses are killing it.', '2007-01-05 11:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184754, 445009, 68685, '<td valign="top">Great color and DOF!</td>', 'Great color and DOF!', '2007-01-05 12:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184777, 445158, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think some additional lighting to eliminate the shadow on her eyes would help.  Good pose and outfit though.</td>', 'I think some additional lighting to eliminate the shadow on her eyes would help.  Good pose and outfit though.', '2007-01-05 12:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184782, 444198, 43565, '<td valign="top">Cropped a little too tight on the sides for me, but good lighting and focus.</td>', 'Cropped a little too tight on the sides for me, but good lighting and focus.', '2007-01-05 12:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184796, 440863, 43565, '<td valign="top">My eye is drawn to the blond hair and chest area, but these areas are do not show anything interesting.</td>', 'My eye is drawn to the blond hair and chest area, but these areas are do not show anything interesting.', '2007-01-05 12:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
