(3184904, 445163, 27137, '<td valign="top">cool idea.. 7</td>', 'cool idea.. 7', '2007-01-05 13:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184960, 442244, 32321, '<td valign="top">The soother takes away from the picture...other than that, an excellent shot!</td>', 'The soother takes away from the picture...other than that, an excellent shot!', '2007-01-05 13:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184982, 441800, 15204, '<td valign="top">Nice job panning and keeping his face so sharp.  A cool motion shot with a less common subject (usually I see cars and bikes, etc).  The title goes with it perfectly.  I love the little guy''s expression.  The whites on the hat are the only thing I would change about this image, and that is a minor nitpick.  Very nice shot. 8 from me.</td>', 'Nice job panning and keeping his face so sharp.  A cool motion shot with a less common subject (usually I see cars and bikes, etc).  The title goes with it perfectly.  I love the little guy''s expression.  The whites on the hat are the only thing I would change about this image, and that is a minor nitpick.  Very nice shot. 8 from me.', '2007-01-05 13:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184983, 441476, 15204, '<td valign="top">I have seen this kind of shot many times before, and I think you really added something unique to it with the angle here.  I also like how you cropped in tight and touched the wheel to the edge of the frame.  Very cool shot. 8 from me.</td>', 'I have seen this kind of shot many times before, and I think you really added something unique to it with the angle here.  I also like how you cropped in tight and touched the wheel to the edge of the frame.  Very cool shot. 8 from me.', '2007-01-05 13:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184984, 440652, 15204, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and pretty lighting, coming in from both sides.  Her eyes really sparkle with the ''double'' catchlights.  I like the lines of the compostion very much.  The line of the back of her arm, to me, is like an inverted reflection of the line of the right side of her face.  I hope that makes sense :)  ANyway, I really like this.  8 from me.</td>', 'Very interesting and pretty lighting, coming in from both sides.  Her eyes really sparkle with the ''double'' catchlights.  I like the lines of the compostion very much.  The line of the back of her arm, to me, is like an inverted reflection of the line of the right side of her face.  I hope that makes sense :)  ANyway, I really like this.  8 from me.', '2007-01-05 13:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184987, 444775, 15204, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped more off the top on this one.  Probably all of the pink part sof the hat, so just the horizontal hat band was along the top of the frame.  The lighting and contrasty post-processing give great texture to his beard and the lines of his face.  It really tells a story.  8 from me.</td>', 'I think I would have cropped more off the top on this one.  Probably all of the pink part sof the hat, so just the horizontal hat band was along the top of the frame.  The lighting and contrasty post-processing give great texture to his beard and the lines of his face.  It really tells a story.  8 from me.', '2007-01-05 13:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184988, 443640, 15204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful black and white.  FOr some reason, I especially like the fence taking up the lower corner of the frame.  Beautiful job with your dynamic range and black and white conversion. 8 from me.</td>', 'Beautiful black and white.  FOr some reason, I especially like the fence taking up the lower corner of the frame.  Beautiful job with your dynamic range and black and white conversion. 8 from me.', '2007-01-05 13:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184989, 443549, 15204, '<td valign="top">THe only thing I wish were different on this image would be to not have the island cutting through the figure of the child.  I think it is distracting and a little confusing.  Maybe it would also be nice to have his arm extended a tiny bit to seperate it from his body so that we can see it.  That is the tough part about silohuettes.  Other than those two small things, this image is total perfection.  A wonderful profile so we can see the boy''s features.  Nice highlights on the water and still some detail in the shadows (on my monitor).  Great angle to put the boy''s head above the horizon.  Overall nice balance and a sweet, calm mood.  Very nice.  8 from me.</td>', 'THe only thing I wish were different on this image would be to not have the island cutting through the figure of the child.  I think it is distracting and a little confusing.  Maybe it would also be nice to have his arm extended a tiny bit to seperate it from his body so that we can see it.  That is the tough part about silohuettes.  Other than those two small things, this image is total perfection.  A wonderful profile so we can see the boy''s features.  Nice highlights on the water and still some detail in the shadows (on my monitor).  Great angle to put the boy''s head above the horizon.  Overall nice balance and a sweet, calm mood.  Very nice.  8 from me.', '2007-01-05 13:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184990, 442784, 15204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting!  Wonderful job finding soft but directional light outdoors.  Your colors are very nice.  I like the reflection in her glasses with the blown out sky and the plams.  It is striking and maybe even a little off-putting at first, but I think that really gives mood to the image (and goes with your title). 7 from me.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting!  Wonderful job finding soft but directional light outdoors.  Your colors are very nice.  I like the reflection in her glasses with the blown out sky and the plams.  It is striking and maybe even a little off-putting at first, but I think that really gives mood to the image (and goes with your title). 7 from me.', '2007-01-05 13:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184991, 439846, 15204, '<td valign="top">Interesting and beautiful colors.  I like the lines and blocks (for lack of a better word) of color and texture created by all of the elements in this image.  Very nice seen and composed.</td>', 'Interesting and beautiful colors.  I like the lines and blocks (for lack of a better word) of color and texture created by all of the elements in this image.  Very nice seen and composed.', '2007-01-05 13:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184992, 444761, 15204, '<td valign="top">Beautficul colors, detail and sharpness.  Very pretty.</td>', 'Beautficul colors, detail and sharpness.  Very pretty.', '2007-01-05 13:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184993, 443062, 15204, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasty post-processing that you have done here.  It realy suits the mood of the image.  I think the chain link fence, though busier than I would normally prefer for a portrait, really works here, too.  It all makes such a busy and rough texture that gives the image a kind of grittiness that seems to really go with the subject matter.  7 from me.</td>', 'I like the contrasty post-processing that you have done here.  It realy suits the mood of the image.  I think the chain link fence, though busier than I would normally prefer for a portrait, really works here, too.  It all makes such a busy and rough texture that gives the image a kind of grittiness that seems to really go with the subject matter.  7 from me.', '2007-01-05 13:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184994, 443692, 15204, '<td valign="top">The oranges of the sunset contrast wonderfully with the blues of the ice, making them look even bluer.  Very nice.</td>', 'The oranges of the sunset contrast wonderfully with the blues of the ice, making them look even bluer.  Very nice.', '2007-01-05 13:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184996, 443630, 32345, '<td valign="top">This seems to be very good but your picture is really too small to be fully appreciated.</td>', 'This seems to be very good but your picture is really too small to be fully appreciated.', '2007-01-05 13:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184997, 441109, 15204, '<td valign="top">I like your compostition and especially the low camera position on this image.  It works really well.  Nice colors and a very pretty winter scene.  7 from me.</td>', 'I like your compostition and especially the low camera position on this image.  It works really well.  Nice colors and a very pretty winter scene.  7 from me.', '2007-01-05 13:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3184998, 445188, 15204, '<td valign="top">This somehow seems to have a soft focus yet be full of detail and texture at the same time.  I lingered on it for awhile, so it gets a couple extra points just for that.  I love the super close crop.  7 from me.</td>', 'This somehow seems to have a soft focus yet be full of detail and texture at the same time.  I lingered on it for awhile, so it gets a couple extra points just for that.  I love the super close crop.  7 from me.', '2007-01-05 13:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3185000, 443811, 15204, '<td valign="top">Very beautifully lit.  Very flattering light on your model, and I like the back light, too.  My two small suggestions would be...her legs (and to a much smaller degree her arms) seem bluer than the skin on her checst and face, probably because of the light falloff.  I might warm them up a bit.  Two, the back of her hand is not very flattering and feminine (not her hand, in particular, women''s hands in general are best not posed with the back directly towards the camera).  Her eyes really come out, even though her pose and hairstyle all keep them sort of hidden, which I think is very suited to the mood you are creating.</td>', 'Very beautifully lit.  Very flattering light on your model, and I like the back light, too.  My two small suggestions would be...her legs (and to a much smaller degree her arms) seem bluer than the skin on her checst and face, probably because of the light falloff.  I might warm them up a bit.  Two, the back of her hand is not very flattering and feminine (not her hand, in particular, women''s hands in general are best not posed with the back directly towards the camera).  Her eyes really come out, even though her pose and hairstyle all keep them sort of hidden, which I think is very suited to the mood you are creating.', '2007-01-05 13:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3185002, 442337, 15204, '<td valign="top">I think in general it is hard to compose an image of ''just the water'' for waterfalls.  You have really done it here.  The lines and shapes of the water (and that tiny bit of rock) make this an interesting and engaging image for me.  7.</td>', 'I think in general it is hard to compose an image of ''just the water'' for waterfalls.  You have really done it here.  The lines and shapes of the water (and that tiny bit of rock) make this an interesting and engaging image for me.  7.', '2007-01-05 13:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3185004, 444924, 32345, '<td valign="top">The focus should have been on the front part of the book, it would have look much better.</td>', 'The focus should have been on the front part of the book, it would have look much better.', '2007-01-05 13:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3185028, 441709, 32345, '<td valign="top">I just don''t know.... it seems that there is something wrong with this picture... the eyes? Yeah, not sure but I think that this is the problem. but this is just my opinion.</td>', 'I just don''t know.... it seems that there is something wrong with this picture... the eyes? Yeah, not sure but I think that this is the problem. but this is just my opinion.', '2007-01-05 13:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3185210, 443454, 30608, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you have a mix of people who like this, and a mix that don''t. I personally think it''s great just because it is so different. I''ll be anxious to see where this ends up. Good Luck to you! 7</td>', 'I''m sure you have a mix of people who like this, and a mix that don''t. I personally think it''s great just because it is so different. I''ll be anxious to see where this ends up. Good Luck to you! 7', '2007-01-05 14:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
