(3185359, 438502, 66201, '<td valign="top">One of my all-time favourite paintings...but I am sad to see that you left out/neglected the primary detail...the pearl earring ...? I wonder why you went for that option instead of a full recreation. It''s so clear and precise that at first glance it looks like the painting and then you look again and it''s not...part of the great effect this has.<br/> <br/>Fantastic notion though: this could lead to a whole challenge topic - Recreating the Master''s Works.</td>', 'One of my all-time favourite paintings...but I am sad to see that you left out/neglected the primary detail...the pearl earring ...? I wonder why you went for that option instead of a full recreation. It''s so clear and precise that at first glance it looks like the painting and then you look again and it''s not...part of the great effect this has. Fantastic notion though: this could lead to a whole challenge topic - Recreating the Master''s Works.', '2007-01-05 16:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
