(3189009, 443470, 59415, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, and it is a spectacular bird.  I wish you could have got a shot of the bird looking more at the camera.  That would have really made it work for me.</td>', 'I like this photo, and it is a spectacular bird.  I wish you could have got a shot of the bird looking more at the camera.  That would have really made it work for me.', '2007-01-06 17:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189014, 445246, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is a cool photo.  Then you add the exceptional background that makes this photo go from ordinary to extrodinary.  I would like the red shirt in the upper corner cloned out. imo</td>', 'This is a cool photo.  Then you add the exceptional background that makes this photo go from ordinary to extrodinary.  I would like the red shirt in the upper corner cloned out. imo', '2007-01-06 17:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189017, 444021, 59415, '<td valign="top">A little more light would have helped this.  With the lack of light it feels a bit somber, but his expression wouldn''t lead me to believe that this is to be a somber photo.</td>', 'A little more light would have helped this.  With the lack of light it feels a bit somber, but his expression wouldn''t lead me to believe that this is to be a somber photo.', '2007-01-06 17:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
