(3189703, 444436, 36999, '<td valign="top">The whiter section of sky between tree 2 and 3 is distracting, kinda like you missed a spot.  I wish the house was just a tad lighter too.  Love the composition and conversion to B/W.</td>', 'The whiter section of sky between tree 2 and 3 is distracting, kinda like you missed a spot.  I wish the house was just a tad lighter too.  Love the composition and conversion to B/W.', '2007-01-06 22:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189710, 442528, 36999, '<td valign="top">nice color, love the car''s color and the reflections on it.  I''d like it even better if the pic didn''t seems to ''list'' clockwise.  Maybe if you rotated it a bit so the bridge columns were a bit more upright.</td>', 'nice color, love the car''s color and the reflections on it.  I''d like it even better if the pic didn''t seems to ''list'' clockwise.  Maybe if you rotated it a bit so the bridge columns were a bit more upright.', '2007-01-06 22:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189715, 442344, 36999, '<td valign="top">very nice, I keep trying to look further around the bend!</td>', 'very nice, I keep trying to look further around the bend!', '2007-01-06 22:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189725, 441231, 19978, '<td valign="top">Incredibly nice portrait. The sideways glance and richly saturated colors are great. I absolutely love the crop and the eyes are captivating. Nicely done!</td>', 'Incredibly nice portrait. The sideways glance and richly saturated colors are great. I absolutely love the crop and the eyes are captivating. Nicely done!', '2007-01-06 22:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189727, 444274, 36999, '<td valign="top">so much processing it''s kinda creepy looking.</td>', 'so much processing it''s kinda creepy looking.', '2007-01-06 22:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189739, 444612, 19978, '<td valign="top">Exceptionally nice job. If not for the star trails in the sky, it would look like an overcast day. I''ll be back to look at the details of this shot.</td>', 'Exceptionally nice job. If not for the star trails in the sky, it would look like an overcast day. I''ll be back to look at the details of this shot.', '2007-01-06 22:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189756, 442244, 55767, '<td valign="top">thats such a sweet photo</td>', 'thats such a sweet photo', '2007-01-06 22:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189772, 444353, 23053, '<td valign="top">Great color in this shot.  Nice toes, too.</td>', 'Great color in this shot.  Nice toes, too.', '2007-01-06 22:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189777, 444049, 6388, '<td valign="top">as i''m sure you''ve heard a few times already...a little heavy on the noise reduction and sharpening.  the effect is actually kinda cool, but doesn''t go over too well in challenges.  If it was intentional - good on ya for sticking with what you like.  if it wasn''t intentional...next time try doing the noise reduction on a duplicate layer and then dropping the opacity to retain the original integrity of the image.<br/> <br/>other than that, I like the muted colours and the composition.  the black one looking me in the face is the anchor of the image and adds a ton of character to it.<br/> <br/>P</td>', 'as i''m sure you''ve heard a few times already...a little heavy on the noise reduction and sharpening.  the effect is actually kinda cool, but doesn''t go over too well in challenges.  If it was intentional - good on ya for sticking with what you like.  if it wasn''t intentional...next time try doing the noise reduction on a duplicate layer and then dropping the opacity to retain the original integrity of the image. other than that, I like the muted colours and the composition.  the black one looking me in the face is the anchor of the image and adds a ton of character to it. P', '2007-01-06 22:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189786, 442411, 23053, '<td valign="top">Well timed capture.  Good luck to you and to the little nose miner...may he find what he is looking for.</td>', 'Well timed capture.  Good luck to you and to the little nose miner...may he find what he is looking for.', '2007-01-06 22:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189796, 439846, 23053, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, fantabulous composition, and a subject that aches to be seen.  May the front page gods shine on you this week.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, fantabulous composition, and a subject that aches to be seen.  May the front page gods shine on you this week.', '2007-01-06 22:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189798, 445188, 55767, '<td valign="top">love his ice blue eyes</td>', 'love his ice blue eyes', '2007-01-06 22:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189806, 445061, 7485, '<td valign="top">Cute kid, but the little bit of blue in the eyes and no other color else doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Cute kid, but the little bit of blue in the eyes and no other color else doesn''t work for me.', '2007-01-06 23:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189814, 445075, 7485, '<td valign="top">Your title implies this is not in an aquarium, if so then I''m seriously impressed! I just wished you pumped up the contrast to get brighter highlights, and maybe shifted the hue a bit to get the highlights whiter.</td>', 'Your title implies this is not in an aquarium, if so then I''m seriously impressed! I just wished you pumped up the contrast to get brighter highlights, and maybe shifted the hue a bit to get the highlights whiter.', '2007-01-06 23:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189819, 436978, 23053, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot...at first I couldn''t tell if her eyes were wide open or mostly closed...still seems hard to decide.  I has kept me looking for a few minutes now.  I like the darkness, the suggestion of form, and the overall intrigue of this shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting shot...at first I couldn''t tell if her eyes were wide open or mostly closed...still seems hard to decide.  I has kept me looking for a few minutes now.  I like the darkness, the suggestion of form, and the overall intrigue of this shot.  Good luck.', '2007-01-06 23:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189852, 443370, 6388, '<td valign="top">oh i like this a lot.  would have liked a little more light on his eyes, but the shadows add a little mystery and a solemn mood.  love the shallow DOF.</td>', 'oh i like this a lot.  would have liked a little more light on his eyes, but the shadows add a little mystery and a solemn mood.  love the shallow DOF.', '2007-01-06 23:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189855, 443278, 50695, '<td valign="top">exquisite. 9</td>', 'exquisite. 9', '2007-01-06 23:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
