(3189858, 439846, 50695, '<td valign="top">now, that is an interesting combination of foreground and background. I find so few good landscapes around here. Thank you! 8</td>', 'now, that is an interesting combination of foreground and background. I find so few good landscapes around here. Thank you! 8', '2007-01-06 23:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
