(3189901, 444719, 23458, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming the grain is intentional, but it probably won''t be well received here. Not that that should stop you from using it. I like the composition here quite a lot, but the focus seems a little off - almost as if you''ve taken a photo of an old image and it hasn''t worked all that well.</td>', 'I''m assuming the grain is intentional, but it probably won''t be well received here. Not that that should stop you from using it. I like the composition here quite a lot, but the focus seems a little off - almost as if you''ve taken a photo of an old image and it hasn''t worked all that well.', '2007-01-06 23:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
