(3189978, 441413, 32767, '<td valign="top">Very McCurry. I dig it. 10</td>', 'Very McCurry. I dig it. 10', '2007-01-06 23:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189979, 437887, 23458, '<td valign="top">Love the warm colours and their contrast with the blue sky. Seems to be some haloing where (I''m assuming) you selected and darkened the sky. Oh, and the border is a bit off-putting. These minor issues aside this is an effective image.</td>', 'Love the warm colours and their contrast with the blue sky. Seems to be some haloing where (I''m assuming) you selected and darkened the sky. Oh, and the border is a bit off-putting. These minor issues aside this is an effective image.', '2007-01-06 23:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189981, 444778, 51793, '<td valign="top">You at first I saw this and I could see the trees in the background and the house next to it. Then I moved and the screen tilted a little and it faded all out all that and it looked good. I think that you should have adjusted the levels and burned some of the image to get that almost HDR perfect look. I Gave you a 5 but with some better editing I would have gave it a 9. <br/>One more thing, I would have pulled the car out of the drive way and edited out the telephone box in the yard.</td>', 'You at first I saw this and I could see the trees in the background and the house next to it. Then I moved and the screen tilted a little and it faded all out all that and it looked good. I think that you should have adjusted the levels and burned some of the image to get that almost HDR perfect look. I Gave you a 5 but with some better editing I would have gave it a 9. One more thing, I would have pulled the car out of the drive way and edited out the telephone box in the yard.', '2007-01-06 23:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189983, 442141, 51793, '<td valign="top">When birds attack...</td>', 'When birds attack...', '2007-01-06 23:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
