(3189986, 442701, 23458, '<td valign="top">I like this - very nice exposure of the night sky. Great catch of the shooting star. On the down side, I think this could be improved by cropping out the town at the foot of the mountain. The blown out lights distract from the central impact of the shot.</td>', 'I like this - very nice exposure of the night sky. Great catch of the shooting star. On the down side, I think this could be improved by cropping out the town at the foot of the mountain. The blown out lights distract from the central impact of the shot.', '2007-01-06 23:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189987, 436119, 50695, '<td valign="top">good colors. I notice it''s missing a certain flash of sharpness that <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=8860" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Imagineer</a> is able to capture in his motion photos, but it works in this case. 8</td>', 'good colors. I notice it''s missing a certain flash of sharpness that  Imagineer is able to capture in his motion photos, but it works in this case. 8', '2007-01-06 23:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189991, 440885, 23458, '<td valign="top">Terrific image. This guy is obviously a real character, and you succeed admirably in telling his tale. Like the central composition but wish the writing didn''t protrude from his right ear (on the viewer''s left). 8</td>', 'Terrific image. This guy is obviously a real character, and you succeed admirably in telling his tale. Like the central composition but wish the writing didn''t protrude from his right ear (on the viewer''s left). 8', '2007-01-06 23:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3189993, 443695, 51793, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. This is going to be my Xmas card next year. Well If my kids, haha but the idea is wonderful.</td>', 'I love this picture. This is going to be my Xmas card next year. Well If my kids, haha but the idea is wonderful.', '2007-01-06 23:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190001, 444979, 23458, '<td valign="top">I like what your going for - emotive. I also like the way the window is framed by the plant. However, as it stands this image is a bit flat. In future, make sure it''s closer to 640 pixels on its longest side. <br/> <br/>Also, you should try playing around with curves/contrast to give it a little punch. If you''re stuck without proper image editing software (as I am), download the GIMP. It''s a great program and free.</td>', 'I like what your going for - emotive. I also like the way the window is framed by the plant. However, as it stands this image is a bit flat. In future, make sure it''s closer to 640 pixels on its longest side.  Also, you should try playing around with curves/contrast to give it a little punch. If you''re stuck without proper image editing software (as I am), download the GIMP. It''s a great program and free.', '2007-01-06 23:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190007, 442116, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a solid image. However, I think the colours are a bit oversaturated, and, while I know you''re trying to get as much of the cool reflection involved as possible, I think it would be served well by cropping off about an inch at the bottom.</td>', 'This is a solid image. However, I think the colours are a bit oversaturated, and, while I know you''re trying to get as much of the cool reflection involved as possible, I think it would be served well by cropping off about an inch at the bottom.', '2007-01-06 23:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190015, 435842, 23458, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy your treatment of this tender moment. An excellent, understated capture. 8.</td>', 'I really enjoy your treatment of this tender moment. An excellent, understated capture. 8.', '2007-01-06 23:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190022, 444720, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great title - makes what would otherwise be an interesting but possibly uninspiring shot into a nice little piece of social commentary. In technical terms, I might recommend cropping off the black bar at the very top.</td>', 'Great title - makes what would otherwise be an interesting but possibly uninspiring shot into a nice little piece of social commentary. In technical terms, I might recommend cropping off the black bar at the very top.', '2007-01-07 00:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190025, 442024, 23458, '<td valign="top">Hehehe. A very cute, almost surreal image. Kinda wish the donkey (if that''s what it is) on the right had his head a tad higher, but what can ya do. 7.</td>', 'Hehehe. A very cute, almost surreal image. Kinda wish the donkey (if that''s what it is) on the right had his head a tad higher, but what can ya do. 7.', '2007-01-07 00:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190033, 444353, 23458, '<td valign="top">A beautiful woman. This is an image of contrasts - with the dress, the headwear, and the decaying yet beautiful turquoise stairs. Great work.</td>', 'A beautiful woman. This is an image of contrasts - with the dress, the headwear, and the decaying yet beautiful turquoise stairs. Great work.', '2007-01-07 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190047, 439846, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is an immensely pretty scene. I''m assuming, on the basis of the location and title that this is Bear''s work, but I wouldn''t stake my life on that. I''m not sure whether the grassy stuff was positioned by the photog or just found that way - if the latter is true I must congratulate you on your great eye.<br/> <br/>I torn as to whether the treatment of the shells is a little much - they border on neon, but ultimately I think it works. 8.</td>', 'This is an immensely pretty scene. I''m assuming, on the basis of the location and title that this is Bear''s work, but I wouldn''t stake my life on that. I''m not sure whether the grassy stuff was positioned by the photog or just found that way - if the latter is true I must congratulate you on your great eye. I torn as to whether the treatment of the shells is a little much - they border on neon, but ultimately I think it works. 8.', '2007-01-07 00:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190049, 444399, 38648, '<td valign="top">The muzzle blast is so cool</td>', 'The muzzle blast is so cool', '2007-01-07 00:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190052, 445238, 38648, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Dinner.  Nice.</td>', 'Hmmm. Dinner.  Nice.', '2007-01-07 00:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
