(3190658, 438868, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Nice portrait but the pp has resulted in what, in my opinion, looks too ''fake'' an image, especially around the eyes - there is pp work visible.</td>', '3 - Nice portrait but the pp has resulted in what, in my opinion, looks too ''fake'' an image, especially around the eyes - there is pp work visible.', '2007-01-07 06:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
