(3190835, 442244, 66384, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful photo of a beautiful subject. Too bad about the pacifier covering the mouth.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful photo of a beautiful subject. Too bad about the pacifier covering the mouth.', '2007-01-07 08:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190859, 442716, 23053, '<td valign="top">Very interesting processing here...looks entirely like a sketch.  Good luck in the challenge and I''ll come back to read the details.</td>', 'Very interesting processing here...looks entirely like a sketch.  Good luck in the challenge and I''ll come back to read the details.', '2007-01-07 09:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190861, 445376, 23053, '<td valign="top">Can''t it be both?  Interesting shot, here (see, that works both ways, too) but I''m not finding a place to rest my eyes, a point that can give me some meaning for the shot.  Granted, this could be like a modern art painting that is not meant to have a subject like a portrait or a landscape.  Honestly, a detail from the shot, meaning a smaller section, could yield a more pleasing result.  Play around with some crops and see if you come up with something good.  Sorry to give you an assignment, but afterall, this site is about growth.  Good luck.</td>', 'Can''t it be both?  Interesting shot, here (see, that works both ways, too) but I''m not finding a place to rest my eyes, a point that can give me some meaning for the shot.  Granted, this could be like a modern art painting that is not meant to have a subject like a portrait or a landscape.  Honestly, a detail from the shot, meaning a smaller section, could yield a more pleasing result.  Play around with some crops and see if you come up with something good.  Sorry to give you an assignment, but afterall, this site is about growth.  Good luck.', '2007-01-07 09:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190867, 443713, 23053, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  That is all.</td>', 'Beautiful.  That is all.', '2007-01-07 09:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190881, 444990, 23053, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, you have mastered the aurora photograph!  You have helped to inspire DPC to create a wave of copy-cat photographs and similar efforts of long-exposure star-scapes.  You have scored well and set a trend.  Your new challenge:  create another movement, abandon this new encarnation of the ''water-drop, selective de-sat, veiled face''  and keep our front page fresh and unexpected.  Good luck to you this week, and all other weeks.  An eye and mind such as this should not need luck, but I wish it upon you all the same.</td>', 'Congratulations, you have mastered the aurora photograph!  You have helped to inspire DPC to create a wave of copy-cat photographs and similar efforts of long-exposure star-scapes.  You have scored well and set a trend.  Your new challenge:  create another movement, abandon this new encarnation of the ''water-drop, selective de-sat, veiled face''  and keep our front page fresh and unexpected.  Good luck to you this week, and all other weeks.  An eye and mind such as this should not need luck, but I wish it upon you all the same.', '2007-01-07 09:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3190894, 444074, 23053, '<td valign="top">I think this shot needs a bit more attention paid to the composition and form over-all.  The noise and contrast are fine, given that they were your intent.  They provide a graininess that seems to fit.  Good luck this week.</td>', 'I think this shot needs a bit more attention paid to the composition and form over-all.  The noise and contrast are fine, given that they were your intent.  They provide a graininess that seems to fit.  Good luck this week.', '2007-01-07 09:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
