(3191344, 443062, 19978, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the effect created here by the post processing. Having said that, I love the subject and composition. The textures are amazing, from his face to his hands to his clothing, there''s so much to look at here. I wish there was more separation - visually - between the background and the subject. It''s an amazing shot that I think will be punished by your choice of processing. The halo created around his jacket, the duotone appearance, etc.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the effect created here by the post processing. Having said that, I love the subject and composition. The textures are amazing, from his face to his hands to his clothing, there''s so much to look at here. I wish there was more separation - visually - between the background and the subject. It''s an amazing shot that I think will be punished by your choice of processing. The halo created around his jacket, the duotone appearance, etc.', '2007-01-07 12:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
