(3191464, 439682, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice light effect in the drop(s).  Like the concept of bringing the fore ''bar'' out of the frame, but if the lower part of it was done too, and possibly also a slight variation in frame color, so as not to be so dominant, make this better in my opinion.  More refined crop at the top too.</td>', '5 - Nice light effect in the drop(s).  Like the concept of bringing the fore ''bar'' out of the frame, but if the lower part of it was done too, and possibly also a slight variation in frame color, so as not to be so dominant, make this better in my opinion.  More refined crop at the top too.', '2007-01-07 13:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
