(3191476, 442482, 63495, '<td valign="top">very nice. IMO which isnt worth much you have too much out of focus curtain on the right side of photo. I think i would like it better if it was cropped in closer to remove some of the curtain. still a very nice shot</td>', 'very nice. IMO which isnt worth much you have too much out of focus curtain on the right side of photo. I think i would like it better if it was cropped in closer to remove some of the curtain. still a very nice shot', '2007-01-07 13:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3191478, 441462, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice scene and colors and composition.  Could just be a visual thing, but looks like it needs the slightest nudge up on the right.  Bit more detail discernible in the fore - stump, grasses and water, likely make this even better as well, in my opinion.  The seemingly ''blown'' light/white areas - a bit more subtle (difficult when it''s gone) and more ''natural'' looking than as is, which is almost bordering on a surreal type of effect in those areas - which still makes for a unique image.</td>', '7 - Nice scene and colors and composition.  Could just be a visual thing, but looks like it needs the slightest nudge up on the right.  Bit more detail discernible in the fore - stump, grasses and water, likely make this even better as well, in my opinion.  The seemingly ''blown'' light/white areas - a bit more subtle (difficult when it''s gone) and more ''natural'' looking than as is, which is almost bordering on a surreal type of effect in those areas - which still makes for a unique image.', '2007-01-07 13:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
