(3191523, 441462, 19978, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of the stump for subject. This is the type of thing that sinks many otherwise excellent landscapes - lack of a discernible subject. Great job on the technicals too.</td>', 'Excellent use of the stump for subject. This is the type of thing that sinks many otherwise excellent landscapes - lack of a discernible subject. Great job on the technicals too.', '2007-01-07 13:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
