(3191549, 445149, 39427, '<td valign="top">haha what''s he doing on the ground like that??  I want to photoshop a monocle onto him.</td>', 'haha what''s he doing on the ground like that??  I want to photoshop a monocle onto him.', '2007-01-07 14:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3191550, 442914, 63495, '<td valign="top">beautiful model. great shot</td>', 'beautiful model. great shot', '2007-01-07 14:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3191557, 440652, 39427, '<td valign="top">beautiful lighting</td>', 'beautiful lighting', '2007-01-07 14:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3191571, 443713, 39427, '<td valign="top">What a capture:  Feels so grand, awesome colors, solid comp.  Should do amazing I''m sure.  The only criticism I have is that the flare is distracting - it disrupts the eye''s movement through the frame, but you probably couldn''t do much about that.  Also, I would have added a border of some sort, white would have looked nice I think.  And perhaps the title shouldn''t be all caps, but these are all minor details, good luck!  9</td>', 'What a capture:  Feels so grand, awesome colors, solid comp.  Should do amazing I''m sure.  The only criticism I have is that the flare is distracting - it disrupts the eye''s movement through the frame, but you probably couldn''t do much about that.  Also, I would have added a border of some sort, white would have looked nice I think.  And perhaps the title shouldn''t be all caps, but these are all minor details, good luck!  9', '2007-01-07 14:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3191576, 445145, 39427, '<td valign="top">Cool pic, though the position of the leaves is a tad distracting</td>', 'Cool pic, though the position of the leaves is a tad distracting', '2007-01-07 14:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3191578, 445196, 39427, '<td valign="top">I like the interesting composition, but the photo is too gray.  A curves adjustment to set the ''white point'' somewhere on the bird would cure this.  Also, applying ''unsharp mask'' would make the image sharper.  Cheers</td>', 'I like the interesting composition, but the photo is too gray.  A curves adjustment to set the ''white point'' somewhere on the bird would cure this.  Also, applying ''unsharp mask'' would make the image sharper.  Cheers', '2007-01-07 14:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3191580, 444663, 39427, '<td valign="top">wow, what wild bokeh, goes great with the cat''s curious expression.</td>', 'wow, what wild bokeh, goes great with the cat''s curious expression.', '2007-01-07 14:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3191584, 445230, 39427, '<td valign="top">This is awesome.  Beautiful post-processing, my choice for top-5</td>', 'This is awesome.  Beautiful post-processing, my choice for top-5', '2007-01-07 14:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3191586, 445149, 68586, '<td valign="top">nice owl.</td>', 'nice owl.', '2007-01-07 14:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
