(3191604, 444324, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice capture.  Just wish the colors were a little brighter and the eyes a little ''clearer''.</td>', '7 - Very nice capture.  Just wish the colors were a little brighter and the eyes a little ''clearer''.', '2007-01-07 14:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3191607, 438362, 68586, '<td valign="top">nice background - nice lighting. I find it a bit odd just having a torso presented (no arms/legs/head), and the fact that the bra clearly isn''t filled is distracting. Perhaps better fitting underware and more of the model next time :)</td>', 'nice background - nice lighting. I find it a bit odd just having a torso presented (no arms/legs/head), and the fact that the bra clearly isn''t filled is distracting. Perhaps better fitting underware and more of the model next time :)', '2007-01-07 14:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
