(3191706, 434506, 62637, '<td valign="top">you have my sympathy: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=439907" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62637/thumb/439907.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62637/thumb/439907.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62637/thumb/439907.jpg"/></a></td>', 'you have my sympathy: ', '2007-01-07 15:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3191712, 445149, 62637, '<td valign="top">it looks so annoyed... i definitely laughed</td>', 'it looks so annoyed... i definitely laughed', '2007-01-07 15:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3191714, 435031, 40355, '<td valign="top">It took me a moment to figure out what this was, but once I did, I was very impressed, and sat looking at it for a while.  It''s subtle, but very emotive, and has a whole range of feelings associated with it.  Very well done, wonderful lighting and composition.  I fear this will not do as well as it deserves, but know that you succeeded.</td>', 'It took me a moment to figure out what this was, but once I did, I was very impressed, and sat looking at it for a while.  It''s subtle, but very emotive, and has a whole range of feelings associated with it.  Very well done, wonderful lighting and composition.  I fear this will not do as well as it deserves, but know that you succeeded.', '2007-01-07 15:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3191718, 445376, 62637, '<td valign="top">funny title...</td>', 'funny title...', '2007-01-07 15:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3191719, 443681, 40355, '<td valign="top">A bit too intense around the sun, but overall very good.  There are several things that really make me like this.  First is the leading lines in the fields and how they are oriented toward the barn.  The second is the light that can be seen coming through the barn doors, and finally, the low clouds and snow, which break up the darkness just right.  Well done! 8</td>', 'A bit too intense around the sun, but overall very good.  There are several things that really make me like this.  First is the leading lines in the fields and how they are oriented toward the barn.  The second is the light that can be seen coming through the barn doors, and finally, the low clouds and snow, which break up the darkness just right.  Well done! 8', '2007-01-07 15:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3191725, 445229, 40355, '<td valign="top">The city in the background really adds the final punch to this shot, as the boat looks like it belongs in a small coastal town, but there it is among all the yachts and the skyscrapers, creating a great diachotomy.  Also lovely colors and exposure, composition, etc - all the technical aspects spot on.  10</td>', 'The city in the background really adds the final punch to this shot, as the boat looks like it belongs in a small coastal town, but there it is among all the yachts and the skyscrapers, creating a great diachotomy.  Also lovely colors and exposure, composition, etc - all the technical aspects spot on.  10', '2007-01-07 15:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3191729, 445198, 40355, '<td valign="top">I''ve got no idea what the title has to do with anything, but I like it - gives a real sense of humor to the shot, which is strong and could easily stand on it''s own, too.  Would be nice if just a bit more of the skull were in sharp focus.</td>', 'I''ve got no idea what the title has to do with anything, but I like it - gives a real sense of humor to the shot, which is strong and could easily stand on it''s own, too.  Would be nice if just a bit more of the skull were in sharp focus.', '2007-01-07 15:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3191730, 443076, 40355, '<td valign="top">I think "Beconing" is really spelled "Beckoning".  But a very nice shot, great detail in the rocks and water, and the capture of the light rays in the background adds interest there too and deepens the image.  Very well done.  8</td>', 'I think "Beconing" is really spelled "Beckoning".  But a very nice shot, great detail in the rocks and water, and the capture of the light rays in the background adds interest there too and deepens the image.  Very well done.  8', '2007-01-07 15:30:11.000000', NULL, 1);
