(3191733, 443454, 40355, '<td valign="top">Intersting entry, very different from anything else I''ve seen on DPC in a long time.  Doesn''t really do it for me, but good luck to you.</td>', 'Intersting entry, very different from anything else I''ve seen on DPC in a long time.  Doesn''t really do it for me, but good luck to you.', '2007-01-07 15:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
