(3191906, 444990, 40355, '<td valign="top">This is as stunning shot.  The depth and vibrancy of the colors is amazing.  It has a solid composition, with objects of interest in both the fore and backgrounds, and is well balanced.  To really kick it over the top, you''ve captured Orion right next to the lights, which helps ground the image and increase its appeal even more.  This is one of those shots that deserves about a twelve, if the scale went that high.  10</td>', 'This is as stunning shot.  The depth and vibrancy of the colors is amazing.  It has a solid composition, with objects of interest in both the fore and backgrounds, and is well balanced.  To really kick it over the top, you''ve captured Orion right next to the lights, which helps ground the image and increase its appeal even more.  This is one of those shots that deserves about a twelve, if the scale went that high.  10', '2007-01-07 16:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
