(3192754, 443681, 25742, '<td valign="top">to my mind this does not bring stillness, rather opression or fear or some evil lurking around the corner. Menance is the word I''m looking for. I think it''s the combination of dark skyes, dark foreground and the dark house. The pattern in the foreground leads you to the dark house, not to the bright sun.</td>', 'to my mind this does not bring stillness, rather opression or fear or some evil lurking around the corner. Menance is the word I''m looking for. I think it''s the combination of dark skyes, dark foreground and the dark house. The pattern in the foreground leads you to the dark house, not to the bright sun.', '2007-01-07 20:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
