(3193115, 444714, 8891, '<td valign="top">I really like everything about this image except for the glasses. They pragmatize the image and take it out of the realm of near fantasy....not explaining it properly I''m sure but in short...they are just so distracting that I cannot fully appreciate the rest of the image as well as if they had not been there. Your model and her apparel and her gorgeous hair all fit so well with the scene....except for...well you know...those things on her face. Heck the sneakers even work for me but not the specs....I think losing both sneaks and specs would have made this better. Damn fine on the whole.9.</td>', 'I really like everything about this image except for the glasses. They pragmatize the image and take it out of the realm of near fantasy....not explaining it properly I''m sure but in short...they are just so distracting that I cannot fully appreciate the rest of the image as well as if they had not been there. Your model and her apparel and her gorgeous hair all fit so well with the scene....except for...well you know...those things on her face. Heck the sneakers even work for me but not the specs....I think losing both sneaks and specs would have made this better. Damn fine on the whole.9.', '2007-01-07 21:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
