(3193754, 442244, 39629, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a great photo Sandy and a strong finish place<br/>My son and his partner have just had a baby boy a few days ago and I think I will be hovering over him with my camera</td>', 'Congrats on a great photo Sandy and a strong finish placeMy son and his partner have just had a baby boy a few days ago and I think I will be hovering over him with my camera', '2007-01-08 00:26:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3193757, 443640, 36371, '<td valign="top">Oh! The detail! and the Lighting! I am so jealous! We just have knobs in Kentucky, but you have peaks!! Someday I will make my way out to Utah. Congratulations on a well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'Oh! The detail! and the Lighting! I am so jealous! We just have knobs in Kentucky, but you have peaks!! Someday I will make my way out to Utah. Congratulations on a well deserved ribbon!', '2007-01-08 00:26:54.000000', NULL, 0),
