(3193791, 443640, 31133, '<td valign="top">Ah, David, congratulations. There were nearly 500 entries and look at you! This is a wonderful b&amp;w of "your" mountains. Add me to the list of those who will never tire of your pictures of these, please. The way you portray them, with all that gorgeous light, makes me a tiny bit jealous not only of where you live, but also of your great skill. Congratulations on the ribbon in a very tough challenge!</td>', 'Ah, David, congratulations. There were nearly 500 entries and look at you! This is a wonderful b&w of "your" mountains. Add me to the list of those who will never tire of your pictures of these, please. The way you portray them, with all that gorgeous light, makes me a tiny bit jealous not only of where you live, but also of your great skill. Congratulations on the ribbon in a very tough challenge!', '2007-01-08 00:32:58.000000', NULL, 0),
