(3194838, 440750, 48890, '<td valign="top">The light is good, but, to me, the composition falls apart in two parts, separated by the line of water.  The dramatic change in texture (smoothness of the sand vs. the small details in the water and the clouds) and colour temperature (colder colours at the top vs. warmer at the bottom) between the two parts is only emphasizing this compositional problem.  You need some "glue" between these two parts.</td>', 'The light is good, but, to me, the composition falls apart in two parts, separated by the line of water.  The dramatic change in texture (smoothness of the sand vs. the small details in the water and the clouds) and colour temperature (colder colours at the top vs. warmer at the bottom) between the two parts is only emphasizing this compositional problem.  You need some "glue" between these two parts.', '2007-01-08 06:56:12.000000', NULL, 0),
