(3194980, 443683, 53147, '<td valign="top">I saw this pic first when Aimee was going through and voting. It grabbed me right there and I knew I was gonn agive this a ten. It was the 4th to last image for me to vote on and I am sorry now that I didnt fave it then. Not sure what I was thinking. I guess I had planned on coming back to bump and comment and didnt get around to it. Excellent picture. Great detail and deadon editing. Congrats on top 20!</td>', 'I saw this pic first when Aimee was going through and voting. It grabbed me right there and I knew I was gonn agive this a ten. It was the 4th to last image for me to vote on and I am sorry now that I didnt fave it then. Not sure what I was thinking. I guess I had planned on coming back to bump and comment and didnt get around to it. Excellent picture. Great detail and deadon editing. Congrats on top 20!', '2007-01-08 07:52:41.000000', NULL, 0),
