(3195111, 435224, 66597, '<td valign="top">Bob,<br/>I have a penchant for liking your photos that don''t do well in challenges. In fact, I like this a lot. There''s a lovely contrast between the warmth in tree bark and cool snow that really draws me in. Believe it or not, I was tempted to put a free study photo in that was similar. Will post in profile. BTW, look at your average from commenters. 7.0!</td>', 'Bob,I have a penchant for liking your photos that don''t do well in challenges. In fact, I like this a lot. There''s a lovely contrast between the warmth in tree bark and cool snow that really draws me in. Believe it or not, I was tempted to put a free study photo in that was similar. Will post in profile. BTW, look at your average from commenters. 7.0!', '2007-01-08 09:05:05.000000', NULL, 0),
