(3196119, 444775, 24073, '<td valign="top">Ok, wow, the big vs.  The Pink Hat VS. The Crop.  I gotta tell ya I don''t like the hat much by the thumbnail, but when I open it I get the pleasent surprise of the contrasting colors with the eyes.  To me I love the spirit in which you left the hat, and the photo is tremendous either way.  Also the pink tells more of the story, so to make you think either he don''t care, or he don''t have the choice, both make an appealing hook.  TY for entering, and congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Ok, wow, the big vs.  The Pink Hat VS. The Crop.  I gotta tell ya I don''t like the hat much by the thumbnail, but when I open it I get the pleasent surprise of the contrasting colors with the eyes.  To me I love the spirit in which you left the hat, and the photo is tremendous either way.  Also the pink tells more of the story, so to make you think either he don''t care, or he don''t have the choice, both make an appealing hook.  TY for entering, and congrats on the ribbon.', '2007-01-08 13:32:25.000000', NULL, 0),
