(3197598, 443414, 30214, '<td valign="top">Agreed with e301 re composition. I would actually crop out a good half of the photo (i mean right half), i.e. make it a "portrait", let the man be more-less in the middle, and let the sun be only visible as a reflection in the window. I think this would make this already very good photo more striking.</td>', 'Agreed with e301 re composition. I would actually crop out a good half of the photo (i mean right half), i.e. make it a "portrait", let the man be more-less in the middle, and let the sun be only visible as a reflection in the window. I think this would make this already very good photo more striking.', '2007-01-08 19:32:13.000000', NULL, 0),
