(3197851, 439081, 43298, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'AWESOME!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2007-01-08 20:49:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3197865, 441110, 57775, '<td valign="top">The best landscape shots IMO are those that make you want to walk into the photo to explore the location yourself.  They convey mystery and excitement - as if maybe, just out of sight somewhere, something beautiful and amazing awaits you.  This grabbed me immediately as one of those photos.  I look at it and I feel an anticipation, a desire to discover what lies behind the trees or down the river.  Absolutely beautiful - one of my favorite shots on DPC.</td>', 'The best landscape shots IMO are those that make you want to walk into the photo to explore the location yourself.  They convey mystery and excitement - as if maybe, just out of sight somewhere, something beautiful and amazing awaits you.  This grabbed me immediately as one of those photos.  I look at it and I feel an anticipation, a desire to discover what lies behind the trees or down the river.  Absolutely beautiful - one of my favorite shots on DPC.', '2007-01-08 20:53:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3197873, 442244, 34113, '<td valign="top">Sandy, the subject is beautiful and the composition and tones are great. Congratulations. (DeniseL)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-09 00:54:43.</i></td>', 'Sandy, the subject is beautiful and the composition and tones are great. Congratulations. (DeniseL)', '2007-01-08 20:55:40.000000', '2007-01-09 00:54:43.000000', 0),
(3197882, 437871, 66597, '<td valign="top">Julianne,<br/>Your photos have definitely gone up a notch in the past month or so, and this is no exception. This guy has amazingly vivid colors, and he''s very sharp. I think the only thing that may have hurt you is the white splotch in the background near top. One thing I learned in the online photo class I took last month was that the eye is always drawn to the brightest area in the picture. In this shot, it detracts from the parrot''s face and pulls the eyes up and out of the photo. Nonetheless, this is a very strong effort and the title is great!</td>', 'Julianne,Your photos have definitely gone up a notch in the past month or so, and this is no exception. This guy has amazingly vivid colors, and he''s very sharp. I think the only thing that may have hurt you is the white splotch in the background near top. One thing I learned in the online photo class I took last month was that the eye is always drawn to the brightest area in the picture. In this shot, it detracts from the parrot''s face and pulls the eyes up and out of the photo. Nonetheless, this is a very strong effort and the title is great!', '2007-01-08 20:58:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3197888, 444252, 34113, '<td valign="top">Amazingly creative and artistic image. Love the composition and grainy texture. (DeniseL)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-09 00:53:50.</i></td>', 'Amazingly creative and artistic image. Love the composition and grainy texture. (DeniseL)', '2007-01-08 21:01:33.000000', '2007-01-09 00:53:50.000000', 0),
(3197890, 444217, 66597, '<td valign="top">Raish,<br/>This is an interesting shot with very nice DOF. I find myself wishing I could see just a bit more of the bottom children''s faces, but the eyes are very captivating. Nice job!</td>', 'Raish,This is an interesting shot with very nice DOF. I find myself wishing I could see just a bit more of the bottom children''s faces, but the eyes are very captivating. Nice job!', '2007-01-08 21:03:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3197892, 445074, 66597, '<td valign="top">Deb,<br/>I''m surprised this one didn''t score higher. I gave it an 8. I think you did very well with the tonal range, and I like the crop. Another great photo!</td>', 'Deb,I''m surprised this one didn''t score higher. I gave it an 8. I think you did very well with the tonal range, and I like the crop. Another great photo!', '2007-01-08 21:05:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3197894, 442258, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. I voted it a 7 and was surprised it didn''t score higher. I think you did an excellent job with lighting and DOF, and the crop is interesting. Nice job!</td>', 'I really like this photo. I voted it a 7 and was surprised it didn''t score higher. I think you did an excellent job with lighting and DOF, and the crop is interesting. Nice job!', '2007-01-08 21:06:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3197899, 444756, 66597, '<td valign="top">Chris,<br/>I enjoy your street photos a lot. The soft focus alone isn''t necessarily a bad thing (though it probably cost you some votes on this uber-sharp-focused forum), but the blown highlights on the shoe and behind the garbage can distract me from this man''s face. I hope you''ll keep getting out there and shooting - I too enjoy street photography and appreciate just how difficult it is!</td>', 'Chris,I enjoy your street photos a lot. The soft focus alone isn''t necessarily a bad thing (though it probably cost you some votes on this uber-sharp-focused forum), but the blown highlights on the shoe and behind the garbage can distract me from this man''s face. I hope you''ll keep getting out there and shooting - I too enjoy street photography and appreciate just how difficult it is!', '2007-01-08 21:09:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3197900, 441110, 22301, '<td valign="top">congrats on the blue, your journey through India looks amazing.</td>', 'congrats on the blue, your journey through India looks amazing.', '2007-01-08 21:10:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3197906, 443967, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot. Underrated, I think. I really like your post-processing choices, and I appreciate the fact that it is deliberately not over-sharpened. The more I look at this, in fact, the more I like it. Don''t let the score get you down on this one - it''s got a lot more going for it than initially meets a quick glance.</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot. Underrated, I think. I really like your post-processing choices, and I appreciate the fact that it is deliberately not over-sharpened. The more I look at this, in fact, the more I like it. Don''t let the score get you down on this one - it''s got a lot more going for it than initially meets a quick glance.', '2007-01-08 21:12:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3197915, 445298, 66597, '<td valign="top">A unique photo with great composition and beautiful colors. I''m not surprised you got two favorites with this one.</td>', 'A unique photo with great composition and beautiful colors. I''m not surprised you got two favorites with this one.', '2007-01-08 21:16:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3197917, 435766, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like zen-type photography, and appreciate the simplicity in this. I also think the composition is strong. I do think the color temperature seems a bit cool. I''d be very interested to see this one with a warming filter (i.e. yellow or orange) to pop the colors in the leaf.</td>', 'I really like zen-type photography, and appreciate the simplicity in this. I also think the composition is strong. I do think the color temperature seems a bit cool. I''d be very interested to see this one with a warming filter (i.e. yellow or orange) to pop the colors in the leaf.', '2007-01-08 21:18:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3197922, 443668, 66597, '<td valign="top">Christian,<br/>I can''t believe this didn''t score higher. I gave it a 7 and think I actually ought to have voted it higher as I look more closely. You did a beautiful job with dodging on the window and doorframes. Mainly, though, I like this for the mood it captures. There is something concurrently inviting and menacing here - must be the juxtoposition of the reds and grays. Great shot.</td>', 'Christian,I can''t believe this didn''t score higher. I gave it a 7 and think I actually ought to have voted it higher as I look more closely. You did a beautiful job with dodging on the window and doorframes. Mainly, though, I like this for the mood it captures. There is something concurrently inviting and menacing here - must be the juxtoposition of the reds and grays. Great shot.', '2007-01-08 21:21:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3197998, 444243, 69050, '<td valign="top">darn i had hoped this would have done better. Oh well live and learn :P I wish more people would have commented to help me know what was wrong with it.</td>', 'darn i had hoped this would have done better. Oh well live and learn :P I wish more people would have commented to help me know what was wrong with it.', '2007-01-08 21:53:41.000000', NULL, 0),
