(3200697, 445058, 16636, '<td valign="top">aaahhhaaa strangely familiar!!</td>', 'aaahhhaaa strangely familiar!!', '2007-01-09 14:35:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200713, 445141, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great shot Tim. I''ve been trying a few of these myself lately. Haven''t been able to get great light on my subject like this though. Clarity on the horse and the jockey''s face is great. Also you''ve managed to get a nice plain background. Well done. Would have been perfect without the 2nd horse there competing for attention. I would be interested in your knowing  your shutter, aperture and ISO used.</td>', 'Great shot Tim. I''ve been trying a few of these myself lately. Haven''t been able to get great light on my subject like this though. Clarity on the horse and the jockey''s face is great. Also you''ve managed to get a nice plain background. Well done. Would have been perfect without the 2nd horse there competing for attention. I would be interested in your knowing  your shutter, aperture and ISO used.', '2007-01-09 14:42:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200733, 442634, 23430, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. Well done.</td>', 'This is a great shot. Well done.', '2007-01-09 14:48:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200753, 442344, 23430, '<td valign="top">Very interesting view of a simple subject. Well done.</td>', 'Very interesting view of a simple subject. Well done.', '2007-01-09 14:54:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200770, 444353, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The composition and contrast in colours is great. Nice lighting on your model''s face. If anything I think the pink dress looks slightly over exposed.</td>', 'Nice shot. The composition and contrast in colours is great. Nice lighting on your model''s face. If anything I think the pink dress looks slightly over exposed.', '2007-01-09 14:58:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200776, 442244, 23430, '<td valign="top">Sandy great shot. Lighting, pose and composition and fantastic. The cuteness has been captured well. Congrats.</td>', 'Sandy great shot. Lighting, pose and composition and fantastic. The cuteness has been captured well. Congrats.', '2007-01-09 15:00:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200784, 444198, 23430, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice. Well done.', '2007-01-09 15:02:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200792, 438517, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great set up and neat shot.</td>', 'Great set up and neat shot.', '2007-01-09 15:04:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200796, 444636, 23430, '<td valign="top">That looks fantastic. Well done to capture the moment.</td>', 'That looks fantastic. Well done to capture the moment.', '2007-01-09 15:04:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200804, 441690, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice photographic house you''ve picked here. Your view point is good and the black and white really suits. Congrats on your top ten finish.</td>', 'Nice photographic house you''ve picked here. Your view point is good and the black and white really suits. Congrats on your top ten finish.', '2007-01-09 15:07:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200808, 439081, 23430, '<td valign="top">Zany idea but works well. Congrats on your top 10 place.</td>', 'Zany idea but works well. Congrats on your top 10 place.', '2007-01-09 15:09:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200823, 441231, 23430, '<td valign="top">Really nice and different portrait. I like the backwards look and how she''s totally to one side to the point where she''s cropped off. The DOF is great and the lighting and colours as well. Well deserved top 5.</td>', 'Really nice and different portrait. I like the backwards look and how she''s totally to one side to the point where she''s cropped off. The DOF is great and the lighting and colours as well. Well deserved top 5.', '2007-01-09 15:13:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200834, 444775, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. The detail, colours, the hat framing the face and the expression are all very good. Well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'Great portrait. The detail, colours, the hat framing the face and the expression are all very good. Well deserved ribbon.', '2007-01-09 15:15:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200860, 441110, 23430, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your Blue. It looks great, hard to pinpoint what''s great it''s just really different light and reflections in this one. No doubt the subject and where you''ve placed them is spot on. Also the monotone throughout even though it''s a colour photo looks great. The more you look at this picture the better it gets. Well done.</td>', 'Congrats on your Blue. It looks great, hard to pinpoint what''s great it''s just really different light and reflections in this one. No doubt the subject and where you''ve placed them is spot on. Also the monotone throughout even though it''s a colour photo looks great. The more you look at this picture the better it gets. Well done.', '2007-01-09 15:21:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3201070, 443370, 48954, '<td valign="top">wow. great work. makes me feel like I have loooots to learn with regards to photography hehe, especially when it coems to taking portraits.<br/> <br/></td>', 'wow. great work. makes me feel like I have loooots to learn with regards to photography hehe, especially when it coems to taking portraits. ', '2007-01-09 16:27:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3201149, 445384, 62671, '<td valign="top">This is a fascinating scene, but it is to busy and distracting.  I would have cropped in closer using the molding as a frame for the statue.  I would love to see the statue closer to make out more of the details. <br/>Although I see what you mean about the lights, It''s not something I would have picked up on without your explanation.  The fine architectural detail of the front desk is very nice and I would have made a seperate image focusing on that as well. <br/></td>', 'This is a fascinating scene, but it is to busy and distracting.  I would have cropped in closer using the molding as a frame for the statue.  I would love to see the statue closer to make out more of the details. Although I see what you mean about the lights, It''s not something I would have picked up on without your explanation.  The fine architectural detail of the front desk is very nice and I would have made a seperate image focusing on that as well. ', '2007-01-09 16:49:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3201365, 441110, 22914, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a photo taken in my place winning a blue ribbon. Kerala is called God''s own Country.</td>', 'Nice to see a photo taken in my place winning a blue ribbon. Kerala is called God''s own Country.', '2007-01-09 17:51:55.000000', NULL, 0),
