(3205084, 436538, 67697, '<td valign="top">Out of the 5 pics, this one is certainly the best.  I love how you captured the sunlight on his face.  You caught him in the "moment" and the lighting enhances that feeling.  There is something about all the darkness on the left that doesn''t sit right with me.  Something needs to intercept it a little.  Have you tried just lighting up his arm and guitar and leave the rest black?  I mean lighting up the parts we don''t see there on the left.  I don''t know if dodging(?) might do that?  Anyway - cool capture!</td>', 'Out of the 5 pics, this one is certainly the best.  I love how you captured the sunlight on his face.  You caught him in the "moment" and the lighting enhances that feeling.  There is something about all the darkness on the left that doesn''t sit right with me.  Something needs to intercept it a little.  Have you tried just lighting up his arm and guitar and leave the rest black?  I mean lighting up the parts we don''t see there on the left.  I don''t know if dodging(?) might do that?  Anyway - cool capture!', '2007-01-10 09:07:02.000000', NULL, 0),
