(3277775, 443669, 14986, '<td valign="top">I have attempted volleyball shots and I know these large area inside gymnasium type shots are very hard!  This one caught my eye.  Her pose and the blue mat give it some impact.  Not perfectly clear, but very nice for the conditions.  I can understand why you like it!</td>', 'I have attempted volleyball shots and I know these large area inside gymnasium type shots are very hard!  This one caught my eye.  Her pose and the blue mat give it some impact.  Not perfectly clear, but very nice for the conditions.  I can understand why you like it!', '2007-01-24 21:52:17.000000', NULL, 0),
