(3456658, 443454, 30214, '<td valign="top">Hey, just came across this photo. I like it a lot, I guess partially because I had a similar idea some time ago<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=270213" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30214/thumb/270213.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30214/thumb/270213.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30214/thumb/270213.jpg"/></a> <br/>based on your finish, I am glad I never entered it in any challenge :)</td>', 'Hey, just came across this photo. I like it a lot, I guess partially because I had a similar idea some time ago based on your finish, I am glad I never entered it in any challenge :)', '2007-03-13 14:18:01.000000', NULL, 0),
