(3521650, 440652, 28742, '<td valign="top">OH MAN - I missed seeing this one. Utterly fantastic shot on all counts - the lighting, sharp focus on those pretty eyes, her pleasant expression, all just wonderful! <br/> <br/>Competition in FS challenges is fierce, so you should be very proud of your score and finish with this. Regardless, you should be very happy to have such a great image of your beautiful niece (Bianca?)<br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'OH MAN - I missed seeing this one. Utterly fantastic shot on all counts - the lighting, sharp focus on those pretty eyes, her pleasant expression, all just wonderful!  Competition in FS challenges is fierce, so you should be very proud of your score and finish with this. Regardless, you should be very happy to have such a great image of your beautiful niece (Bianca?) Well done.', '2007-04-05 08:40:40.000000', NULL, 0),
