(3611153, 443382, 50695, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7. I don''t generally like rose shots because it''s too cliched of a symbol, but the water is creating major distortion here, which adds a lot of interest for me. You also have strong diagonals in the composition.<br/> <br/>And sometimes when I look at this I imagine the bubbles are issuing out of the rose like notes from a small sad bugle.</td>', 'I gave this a 7. I don''t generally like rose shots because it''s too cliched of a symbol, but the water is creating major distortion here, which adds a lot of interest for me. You also have strong diagonals in the composition. And sometimes when I look at this I imagine the bubbles are issuing out of the rose like notes from a small sad bugle.', '2007-05-03 16:09:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3613756, 443382, 51538, '<td valign="top">After shooting a large number of attempted bubble shots, hand held at the beach, I can sympathize with your dilemma.  It is a poignant scene - yet it probably needed a tripod to reveal its true beauty.</td>', 'After shooting a large number of attempted bubble shots, hand held at the beach, I can sympathize with your dilemma.  It is a poignant scene - yet it probably needed a tripod to reveal its true beauty.', '2007-05-04 07:21:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3614959, 443382, 30982, '<td valign="top">Poignant and transitory, both good descriptions of love and life in general.  The flowing water, though, seems to indicate that everything gets washed clean at some point; refreshed.</td>', 'Poignant and transitory, both good descriptions of love and life in general.  The flowing water, though, seems to indicate that everything gets washed clean at some point; refreshed.', '2007-05-04 13:58:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3641972, 445157, 39144, '<td valign="top">This is a very adorable expression that this little girl has. The composition is excellent. In thumbnail view, this shot looks perfect. In the larger view, you can tell that there is some serious problem with the focus. My guess is you have some camera shake in this shot. 1/25 for exposure with a 70-300 lens, probably hand held with natural lighting. Not that I would recommend using the on-camera flash, as I think that generally ruins photos, but maybe using a higher ISO setting to help out with the shutter speed.</td>', 'This is a very adorable expression that this little girl has. The composition is excellent. In thumbnail view, this shot looks perfect. In the larger view, you can tell that there is some serious problem with the focus. My guess is you have some camera shake in this shot. 1/25 for exposure with a 70-300 lens, probably hand held with natural lighting. Not that I would recommend using the on-camera flash, as I think that generally ruins photos, but maybe using a higher ISO setting to help out with the shutter speed.', '2007-05-12 13:14:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3676388, 443935, 51386, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot. I somehow missed it, but couldn''t help but notice it in your profile. Definitely a good choice on the centered composition, and the clarity is stunning for a night shot.</td>', 'This is an amazing shot. I somehow missed it, but couldn''t help but notice it in your profile. Definitely a good choice on the centered composition, and the clarity is stunning for a night shot.', '2007-05-21 19:17:19.000000', NULL, 0),
