(5801057, 442244, 107867, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this pic... try something for me, selective de-saturation... Leave his eyes their natural color and the rest of the pic in black and white... I have one like this of my teenage(eek!) step-daughter and it turned out to be the most gorgeous picture in our whole house because of the colors.  Send me a message if you aren''t sure how to do this, I can help.  :)  Try it!</td>', 'I absolutely love this pic... try something for me, selective de-saturation... Leave his eyes their natural color and the rest of the pic in black and white... I have one like this of my teenage(eek!) step-daughter and it turned out to be the most gorgeous picture in our whole house because of the colors.  Send me a message if you aren''t sure how to do this, I can help.  :)  Try it!', '2010-01-07 19:37:57.000000', NULL, 0),
